(2701026, 374975, 12962, '<td valign="top">The best of the lot ... different and soooo delicious to look at ... actually tried to do this with a cherry but was just not successful.</td>', 'The best of the lot ... different and soooo delicious to look at ... actually tried to do this with a cherry but was just not successful.', '2006-08-07 01:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2701031, 375435, 12962, '<td valign="top">Amazing and difficult shot, not only because of the stopped motion but because of the subject - you really must have patience to get something like this.  And of course the water forming rings around the head ...  just beautiful to look at!</td>', 'Amazing and difficult shot, not only because of the stopped motion but because of the subject - you really must have patience to get something like this.  And of course the water forming rings around the head ...  just beautiful to look at!', '2006-08-07 01:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2701037, 375824, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very difficult shot, you need patience to get something like this and for that I give you a nine.  Of course the bokeh is very nice and the focus on the head is just wonderful.  There is a little bit of motion in the wings and tail but I hope you won''t get much deduction because of that, this being stopped motion challenge.</td>', 'Very difficult shot, you need patience to get something like this and for that I give you a nine.  Of course the bokeh is very nice and the focus on the head is just wonderful.  There is a little bit of motion in the wings and tail but I hope you won''t get much deduction because of that, this being stopped motion challenge.', '2006-08-07 01:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
