(2701924, 375773, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s cool, but lacks a bit of creativity that kind of diminishes the awe-inspiring wowness of the shot; somewhat inevitable if you try to emulate on of the most viewed pictures on the site.  there is no denying it''s technically excellent, but it feels emotionally cold and not very stirring.  7.</td>', 'it''s cool, but lacks a bit of creativity that kind of diminishes the awe-inspiring wowness of the shot; somewhat inevitable if you try to emulate on of the most viewed pictures on the site.  there is no denying it''s technically excellent, but it feels emotionally cold and not very stirring.  7.', '2006-08-07 05:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
