(2701936, 375660, 16004, '<td valign="top">okay, one jet would have been impressive - four strikes me as greedy!  no, this is a very lovely aeronautic picture; the formation suits the framing very well, and would make a lovely poster.  the sky is nice, though a bit  flat, and the only real slight criticism is that the colours of the planes feel a bit too bold and contrasty...  that aside, i think this is a great picture, pin sharp and visually super.  9.</td>', 'okay, one jet would have been impressive - four strikes me as greedy!  no, this is a very lovely aeronautic picture; the formation suits the framing very well, and would make a lovely poster.  the sky is nice, though a bit  flat, and the only real slight criticism is that the colours of the planes feel a bit too bold and contrasty...  that aside, i think this is a great picture, pin sharp and visually super.  9.', '2006-08-07 05:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2701950, 375465, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is great on so many levels, and for so many reasons.  the principal thing is the overall look and style of the shot, makes the whole thing very period.  i love the colours, the sett pavings, the way she seems to be levitating. great clothing too.  the only slight thing is the weird lighting behind her outstretched arm and the slight halo effect round her back, seems like slightly wrong burning or dodging...  but it''s a relatively minor thing; overall this is a great example of great, characterful and stylish photography. 9.</td>', 'this is great on so many levels, and for so many reasons.  the principal thing is the overall look and style of the shot, makes the whole thing very period.  i love the colours, the sett pavings, the way she seems to be levitating. great clothing too.  the only slight thing is the weird lighting behind her outstretched arm and the slight halo effect round her back, seems like slightly wrong burning or dodging...  but it''s a relatively minor thing; overall this is a great example of great, characterful and stylish photography. 9.', '2006-08-07 06:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
