(2702303, 375809, 37252, '<td valign="top">Hope the fishy wasn''t hurt! Cool shot.</td>', 'Hope the fishy wasn''t hurt! Cool shot.', '2006-08-07 09:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702304, 375620, 27137, '<td valign="top">I love Skateboarding phhotography, IMHO this pict has too much dead space on the bottom, I would have cropped tighter</td>', 'I love Skateboarding phhotography, IMHO this pict has too much dead space on the bottom, I would have cropped tighter', '2006-08-07 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702306, 375778, 37252, '<td valign="top">good DOF for this - although as a person who has a phobia of bees it gives me the creeps. still - nice shots get nice scores   :-)</td>', 'good DOF for this - although as a person who has a phobia of bees it gives me the creeps. still - nice shots get nice scores   :-)', '2006-08-07 09:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702314, 375379, 16004, '<td valign="top">it is a good example of timing, but i think it is suffering from a number of odd-composition related things... i feel that the stopped motion bits do not fill enough of the image, and seem almost insignificant as a result.  the lighting is a bit dark and tinged with blue (in Elements or similar colour variations or hue / saturation adjustments might have helped).  finally, the image is too small as well; use save for web to get it to the best quality at the allowable dimensions. 3.</td>', 'it is a good example of timing, but i think it is suffering from a number of odd-composition related things... i feel that the stopped motion bits do not fill enough of the image, and seem almost insignificant as a result.  the lighting is a bit dark and tinged with blue (in Elements or similar colour variations or hue / saturation adjustments might have helped).  finally, the image is too small as well; use save for web to get it to the best quality at the allowable dimensions. 3.', '2006-08-07 09:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702321, 374295, 48228, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail looks great, well done.....</td>', 'The thumbnail looks great, well done.....', '2006-08-07 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702324, 375881, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, as it looks like you were in the right place, at the right time.....Love the sepia tones as well.... A "10" from me...</td>', 'What a great shot, as it looks like you were in the right place, at the right time.....Love the sepia tones as well.... A "10" from me...', '2006-08-07 10:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702326, 375885, 48228, '<td valign="top">I really love this one and joins my number "10" votes..... magical colors and also a magicalimage to match..... I love it.....</td>', 'I really love this one and joins my number "10" votes..... magical colors and also a magicalimage to match..... I love it.....', '2006-08-07 10:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702329, 375580, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is my first "10" for this challenge as it is a great shot.....</td>', 'This is my first "10" for this challenge as it is a great shot.....', '2006-08-07 10:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702333, 375366, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is a very good water stop motion shot.....Perfect balance re rule of thirds as well..... The ducks add a nice touch to complete the image.....</td>', 'This is a very good water stop motion shot.....Perfect balance re rule of thirds as well..... The ducks add a nice touch to complete the image.....', '2006-08-07 10:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702336, 374465, 16004, '<td valign="top">this fits the challenge nicely, and it''s nicely composed.  i do feel that the contrast and diffuse glow is a tad excessive (the trees seem too oppressively dark and the glow has left an off putting halo around the girls arms and head).  but i like it muchly; the style is happy and carefree, which is somehow enhanced by floaty skirt and the lack of shoes (nice touch!).  it''s a warm feeling shot...  i like the greyscale, i do, but i''d like to know how it looks in colour...  8.</td>', 'this fits the challenge nicely, and it''s nicely composed.  i do feel that the contrast and diffuse glow is a tad excessive (the trees seem too oppressively dark and the glow has left an off putting halo around the girls arms and head).  but i like it muchly; the style is happy and carefree, which is somehow enhanced by floaty skirt and the lack of shoes (nice touch!).  it''s a warm feeling shot...  i like the greyscale, i do, but i''d like to know how it looks in colour...  8.', '2006-08-07 10:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702340, 375359, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WOW" this is a good shot..... Great timing.....</td>', '"WOW" this is a good shot..... Great timing.....', '2006-08-07 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702341, 375771, 35334, '<td valign="top">I hate selective desat. There wasn''t much motion to stop. So why am I giving this a ten? Because it is a wonderful image and a brilliant interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I hate selective desat. There wasn''t much motion to stop. So why am I giving this a ten? Because it is a wonderful image and a brilliant interpretation of the challenge.', '2006-08-07 10:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
