(2702533, 374493, 31403, '<td valign="top">oh, yours is much better than mine!  Love the cone there - I''ll have to try shooting mine in the light next time!  :-)<br/> <br/>The wide angle distortion keeps energy in a static shot too - very nice</td>', 'oh, yours is much better than mine!  Love the cone there - I''ll have to try shooting mine in the light next time!  :-) The wide angle distortion keeps energy in a static shot too - very nice', '2006-08-07 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
