(2702588, 375257, 60009, '<td valign="top">The bottom left corner bothers me, maybe it would look better if the hand was rotated so less thumb was showing?  Also the dirty finger are distracting.  I love how sharp the apple and water droplets are.</td>', 'The bottom left corner bothers me, maybe it would look better if the hand was rotated so less thumb was showing?  Also the dirty finger are distracting.  I love how sharp the apple and water droplets are.', '2006-08-07 12:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702601, 375452, 30049, '<td valign="top">Where''s Godzilla?  ;^)  It''s a cute pic but I think the subject is too small to do well in this challenge.  JMO of course.  The clouds are mighty blue...did you push the saturation a bit?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Where''s Godzilla?  ;^)  It''s a cute pic but I think the subject is too small to do well in this challenge.  JMO of course.  The clouds are mighty blue...did you push the saturation a bit?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702602, 375686, 60009, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this photo.  Makes me want to hang it on my wall to remind me of the beach/cottage.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this photo.  Makes me want to hang it on my wall to remind me of the beach/cottage.', '2006-08-07 12:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702609, 374640, 30049, '<td valign="top">That bee doesn''t have enough pollen on it to head home yet.  ;^)  Your image seems a little soft, although it could be this work monitor.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That bee doesn''t have enough pollen on it to head home yet.  ;^)  Your image seems a little soft, although it could be this work monitor.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702612, 375773, 30049, '<td valign="top">Figured we see a few of these.  I''m a bit jealous because I don''t have the setup for it.  :-(  You''ve done a nice job capturing the splash...nice and sharp and I''m glad you didn''t center it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Figured we see a few of these.  I''m a bit jealous because I don''t have the setup for it.  :-(  You''ve done a nice job capturing the splash...nice and sharp and I''m glad you didn''t center it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702613, 374776, 60009, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see different lighting used as it seems to washed out.  Also maybe moving the knife in between the pointy finger and the thumb would be better.  Right now the hand makes me think of monkey feet.  :)</td>', 'I''d like to see different lighting used as it seems to washed out.  Also maybe moving the knife in between the pointy finger and the thumb would be better.  Right now the hand makes me think of monkey feet.  :)', '2006-08-07 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702620, 375591, 60009, '<td valign="top">great photo, I think it would be better with some of the left side cropped out.</td>', 'great photo, I think it would be better with some of the left side cropped out.', '2006-08-07 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702622, 373912, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I know that water fountain!!!  Just kidding...  I do pass a couple of them similar and this type of image did cross my mind.  ;^)  I''m thinking this will end up middle of the pack.  The stopped motion is bit too far away I think for maximum impact.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey!  I know that water fountain!!!  Just kidding...  I do pass a couple of them similar and this type of image did cross my mind.  ;^)  I''m thinking this will end up middle of the pack.  The stopped motion is bit too far away I think for maximum impact.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702624, 375678, 30049, '<td valign="top">Should have saved this for the Fire challenge.  ;^)  Interesting image.  A bit grainy thou.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Should have saved this for the Fire challenge.  ;^)  Interesting image.  A bit grainy thou.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
