(2702633, 375572, 30049, '<td valign="top">That has to feel good with all the heat!  ;^)  This is one time where a centered composition works fine - can''t see any other way to frame it.  I do wonder how it would look in a portrait orientation with some of the sides cropped out (including some of the water spray edges)?  Just a thought.  Fun image nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That has to feel good with all the heat!  ;^)  This is one time where a centered composition works fine - can''t see any other way to frame it.  I do wonder how it would look in a portrait orientation with some of the sides cropped out (including some of the water spray edges)?  Just a thought.  Fun image nonetheless.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2702642, 375898, 37629, '<td valign="top">Lol at the title. Great set up!!</td>', 'Lol at the title. Great set up!!', '2006-08-07 12:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
