(2703088, 375322, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the ''pose''.  I think you caught him at a very good moment to freeze the action.  I wish the lighting conditions had been better for this shot.  The surroundings and the man are quite dark, and the blank, white sky doesn''t add  interest to the shot either.  Focus is great.  I like how crisp the lines are in the shot.  The yellow lines in the background are a bit distracting since it''s really the only little bit of color in the photo.  I think those could have easily been cloned out since this was advanced editing.  Good stopped motion for sure!  It made me smile.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'I like the ''pose''.  I think you caught him at a very good moment to freeze the action.  I wish the lighting conditions had been better for this shot.  The surroundings and the man are quite dark, and the blank, white sky doesn''t add  interest to the shot either.  Focus is great.  I like how crisp the lines are in the shot.  The yellow lines in the background are a bit distracting since it''s really the only little bit of color in the photo.  I think those could have easily been cloned out since this was advanced editing.  Good stopped motion for sure!  It made me smile.~Heather~', '2006-08-07 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
