(2703139, 375580, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great job with the stopped motion.  The vertical orientation of the photo is bugging me though.  I keep turning my head to the side to view it.  I''m sure I''ll be the only person that it bothers, but it does have a huge impact on the photo for me.<br/>Focus and clarity are amazing.  Great detail in the water and hair.  I love the colors too.  Excellent stopped motion, perfect for the challenge.<br/>Lighting on her face could be a little more even but it doesn''t distract from the photo at all.<br/>Congrats.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Great job with the stopped motion.  The vertical orientation of the photo is bugging me though.  I keep turning my head to the side to view it.  I''m sure I''ll be the only person that it bothers, but it does have a huge impact on the photo for me.Focus and clarity are amazing.  Great detail in the water and hair.  I love the colors too.  Excellent stopped motion, perfect for the challenge.Lighting on her face could be a little more even but it doesn''t distract from the photo at all.Congrats.~Heather~', '2006-08-07 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
