(2703419, 375591, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great capture and treatment. From this perspective it looks like he won''t clear the rock!</td>', 'Great capture and treatment. From this perspective it looks like he won''t clear the rock!', '2006-08-07 16:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703425, 375809, 58728, '<td valign="top">OH my GOD! How on earth did you do that?  I''m almost scared for the poor fishy!  But it''s a great shot.  I LOVE it.  Very creative.</td>', 'OH my GOD! How on earth did you do that?  I''m almost scared for the poor fishy!  But it''s a great shot.  I LOVE it.  Very creative.', '2006-08-07 16:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703426, 375739, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good color in the HB.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a bit tighter so the bird is a little larger in the frame.  Nice job stopping the motion.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good color in the HB.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten a bit tighter so the bird is a little larger in the frame.  Nice job stopping the motion.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703429, 375463, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Excellent. Hope this does well for you.', '2006-08-07 16:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703431, 375597, 8367, '<td valign="top">A very sweet capture. I feel the blur treatment was not a good choice for this challenge as it makes it appear as motion blur.</td>', 'A very sweet capture. I feel the blur treatment was not a good choice for this challenge as it makes it appear as motion blur.', '2006-08-07 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703432, 375858, 52549, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Great shot.</td>', 'Ouch!  Great shot.', '2006-08-07 16:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703437, 375849, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Beautiful colours.</td>', 'Very cool. Beautiful colours.', '2006-08-07 16:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703456, 375411, 8367, '<td valign="top">A nice capture. The resize is a bit small for viewing/voting properly.<br/>Also, it could be brighter.</td>', 'A nice capture. The resize is a bit small for viewing/voting properly.Also, it could be brighter.', '2006-08-07 16:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703462, 374989, 52549, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this shot is leaning to the right and not what I''d call "stop motion". However, for your out of the box thinking and the unusual perspective, I''ll give you a 6.</td>', 'Sorry, but this shot is leaning to the right and not what I''d call "stop motion". However, for your out of the box thinking and the unusual perspective, I''ll give you a 6.', '2006-08-07 16:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703504, 375260, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and would love to know how you did it, if you have time to let me know. I am just getting going and don''t know much!</td>', 'I like this a lot and would love to know how you did it, if you have time to let me know. I am just getting going and don''t know much!', '2006-08-07 16:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703515, 375891, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like the simple composition and strong wing colour</td>', 'I like the simple composition and strong wing colour', '2006-08-07 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703518, 375660, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of this. Good luck</td>', 'I like the symmetry of this. Good luck', '2006-08-07 16:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703521, 375514, 58330, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well captured</td>', 'Great idea and well captured', '2006-08-07 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703527, 375898, 58330, '<td valign="top">I hope you show how you did this. I look forward to finding out. Good shot!</td>', 'I hope you show how you did this. I look forward to finding out. Good shot!', '2006-08-07 16:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703531, 375648, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a nice enough photo on its own, well composed and dramatic. But I don''t really see it stopping motion.</td>', 'This is a nice enough photo on its own, well composed and dramatic. But I don''t really see it stopping motion.', '2006-08-07 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703534, 374989, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the politicians mouths were working furiously, but I don''t really see this as stopping motion.</td>', 'I''m sure the politicians mouths were working furiously, but I don''t really see this as stopping motion.', '2006-08-07 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703537, 375771, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the photo a lot. Dramatic space. Selective desat works well. But in the end, it doesn''t really demonstrate stopping motion to me.</td>', 'I like the photo a lot. Dramatic space. Selective desat works well. But in the end, it doesn''t really demonstrate stopping motion to me.', '2006-08-07 16:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703538, 375907, 30049, '<td valign="top">???  This is good.  Take an image of something that I don''t know what it is, therefore don''t know if it''s really been captured in a ''Stopped Motion'' state or not?  Guess we''ll find out after the challenge...hope you have something in your notes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '???  This is good.  Take an image of something that I don''t know what it is, therefore don''t know if it''s really been captured in a ''Stopped Motion'' state or not?  Guess we''ll find out after the challenge...hope you have something in your notes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703539, 375676, 58330, '<td valign="top">Oh yes you did! Did you PP to make the white whiter? It looks just a bit overdone, especially in the tail region which looks blown out. A nice idea though.</td>', 'Oh yes you did! Did you PP to make the white whiter? It looks just a bit overdone, especially in the tail region which looks blown out. A nice idea though.', '2006-08-07 16:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703542, 375784, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not quite quick enough with the shutter speed.  The wall and leaves just in front of her are well focused, but the runner is blurry.  :-(  Close, but no cigar.  ;^)</td>', 'Not quite quick enough with the shutter speed.  The wall and leaves just in front of her are well focused, but the runner is blurry.  :-(  Close, but no cigar.  ;^)', '2006-08-07 16:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703545, 374465, 18197, '<td valign="top">Far too much post processing for my taste. Otherwise a nice dramatic, well composed photo that meets the challenge.</td>', 'Far too much post processing for my taste. Otherwise a nice dramatic, well composed photo that meets the challenge.', '2006-08-07 16:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703549, 375597, 18197, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of (motion) blur going on here. Doesn''t really succeed in stopping the motion in my opinion.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of (motion) blur going on here. Doesn''t really succeed in stopping the motion in my opinion.', '2006-08-07 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703551, 375853, 58330, '<td valign="top">Well captured and very clear, with nice cloud formation in the background</td>', 'Well captured and very clear, with nice cloud formation in the background', '2006-08-07 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703557, 375676, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You actually stopped motion!  Hooray.  ;^)  I say that because many of the animals, water, etc...shots aren''t using high enough shutter speed to truly stop motion.  Now that you''ve gotten past that you are going to have to get past the "it''s too centered" crowd, and possibly the "looks like it''s overexposed" group as well.  ;^)  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  It''s tough trying to please everyone when it comes to getting high scores from voters.  As long as you''re happy that''s what counts the most.  I like your entry.  It''s not "perfect", but it''s pretty darn good.  Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)</td>', 'Wow.  You actually stopped motion!  Hooray.  ;^)  I say that because many of the animals, water, etc...shots aren''t using high enough shutter speed to truly stop motion.  Now that you''ve gotten past that you are going to have to get past the "it''s too centered" crowd, and possibly the "looks like it''s overexposed" group as well.  ;^)  Sorry, couldn''t resist.  It''s tough trying to please everyone when it comes to getting high scores from voters.  As long as you''re happy that''s what counts the most.  I like your entry.  It''s not "perfect", but it''s pretty darn good.  Good luck in the challenge.  ;^)', '2006-08-07 16:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703560, 372964, 58330, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Would have liked to see the ball a bit closer and therefore more prominent as its role in the picture deserves</td>', 'Interesting composition. Would have liked to see the ball a bit closer and therefore more prominent as its role in the picture deserves', '2006-08-07 16:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703562, 375309, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a happy time.  ;^)  I''m finding myself looking more at the faces in the crowd to see their reaction than I am at your primary subject.  Not sure why.  Hmmm.  It''s still fun nonetheless.  Getting some motion blur on the girl being swung around.  Probably will get hit on that a smidgen in the voting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a happy time.  ;^)  I''m finding myself looking more at the faces in the crowd to see their reaction than I am at your primary subject.  Not sure why.  Hmmm.  It''s still fun nonetheless.  Getting some motion blur on the girl being swung around.  Probably will get hit on that a smidgen in the voting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-07 16:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2703570, 375209, 58330, '<td valign="top">Cool moment! Pity about the shadow competing for attention a bit, but the guy is well shown with strong colours against the background</td>', 'Cool moment! Pity about the shadow competing for attention a bit, but the guy is well shown with strong colours against the background', '2006-08-07 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
