(2703582, 375849, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great catch and title!  Wonderful composition and lighting/coloring!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great catch and title!  Wonderful composition and lighting/coloring!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-08-07 16:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
