(2703663, 374085, 30896, '<td valign="top">I already noticed in some past challenges, that planes and helicopters do look somehow dull when stopped in the midair - may be if there would be something more behind than the sky...  otherwise a nice shot and beautiful shade of blue</td>', 'I already noticed in some past challenges, that planes and helicopters do look somehow dull when stopped in the midair - may be if there would be something more behind than the sky...  otherwise a nice shot and beautiful shade of blue', '2006-08-07 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
