(2704730, 374742, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but it would be much better if the shot were level.  Notice the fence in the far background in the top of the shot.  A clock wise rotation with a slight crop would fix this nicely.</td>', 'Great capture, but it would be much better if the shot were level.  Notice the fence in the far background in the top of the shot.  A clock wise rotation with a slight crop would fix this nicely.', '2006-08-08 00:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
