(2704817, 375809, 23458, '<td valign="top">I''m going to go out on a limb and say that you''ve used a photograph of a goldfish rather than the real thing - someone else did something similar a while back. If so, I hope you took the photograph of the goldfish yourself, or asked permission to use it, otherwise it''s bordering on an abuse of someone else''s copyrighted material. I will give you the benefit of the doubt and a 9 for the terrific execution of this image.</td>', 'I''m going to go out on a limb and say that you''ve used a photograph of a goldfish rather than the real thing - someone else did something similar a while back. If so, I hope you took the photograph of the goldfish yourself, or asked permission to use it, otherwise it''s bordering on an abuse of someone else''s copyrighted material. I will give you the benefit of the doubt and a 9 for the terrific execution of this image.', '2006-08-08 01:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
