(2705401, 374295, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a very striking shot; it particularly stood out from the other thumbnails...  the luminosity of the bulb is one of the factors that give this the Wooooh factor that a lot of the other bulbs have - it almost looks like it has liquid within it.  it''s let down slightly by the harshness of the bayonette fitting at the top, but other than that, very effective and well done on the exquisite timing.  9.</td>', 'this is a very striking shot; it particularly stood out from the other thumbnails...  the luminosity of the bulb is one of the factors that give this the Wooooh factor that a lot of the other bulbs have - it almost looks like it has liquid within it.  it''s let down slightly by the harshness of the bayonette fitting at the top, but other than that, very effective and well done on the exquisite timing.  9.', '2006-08-08 07:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705410, 374975, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a great picture, though the fact that it''s been done before (complementary colours i think) lessens the immediate pazzazz of the shot.  the timing is impeccable; the splosh of water out of the top of the glass is super.  and the colours are nice, bright, bold and tasteful.  it''s very likeable; 8.</td>', 'it''s a great picture, though the fact that it''s been done before (complementary colours i think) lessens the immediate pazzazz of the shot.  the timing is impeccable; the splosh of water out of the top of the glass is super.  and the colours are nice, bright, bold and tasteful.  it''s very likeable; 8.', '2006-08-08 07:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705414, 374229, 61996, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and the colours are vibrant but the entire background is distracting. from the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea and the colours are vibrant but the entire background is distracting. from the subject.', '2006-08-08 07:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705416, 375535, 61996, '<td valign="top">Original idea. I like it.</td>', 'Original idea. I like it.', '2006-08-08 07:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705420, 374989, 23394, '<td valign="top">when i see shots like this, i can''t tell if you threw it in just for fun, or if you''re serious.  if you want better scores, maybe check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.<br/> <br/>all in all, in addition to being an extreme shoe-horn for the challenge, it''s a pretty sloppy shot.  horizon is tilted, it''s not very sharp, and it''s over-saturated.  the thing is, it''s a nice idea that probably has it''s place--if executed properly.</td>', 'when i see shots like this, i can''t tell if you threw it in just for fun, or if you''re serious.  if you want better scores, maybe check out this thread. all in all, in addition to being an extreme shoe-horn for the challenge, it''s a pretty sloppy shot.  horizon is tilted, it''s not very sharp, and it''s over-saturated.  the thing is, it''s a nice idea that probably has it''s place--if executed properly.', '2006-08-08 07:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705421, 374521, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, she''s a cutie pie, and probably the subject of many, many snapshots.  but, images like these are destined for the bottom of the heap, because, well, they just don''t convey the essence of the challenge.  if you want better scores, maybe check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'yes, she''s a cutie pie, and probably the subject of many, many snapshots.  but, images like these are destined for the bottom of the heap, because, well, they just don''t convey the essence of the challenge.  if you want better scores, maybe check out this thread.', '2006-08-08 07:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705423, 374493, 16004, '<td valign="top">the cone is an obvious distraction; if it wasn''t so bright it might make a good symmetrical counter device type thing to the lad in the air.  but being such a lurid orange, i just find it overpowering and is vying equally for attention with you main subject.  it really would have been worth cropping just a millimeter above it.  i like the presence  of the bridge though, it complements in terms of colour, angle, and it helps convey a greater sense of height achieved by the skate boarder.  top half = 9, bottom half = 5, so an average of 7</td>', 'the cone is an obvious distraction; if it wasn''t so bright it might make a good symmetrical counter device type thing to the lad in the air.  but being such a lurid orange, i just find it overpowering and is vying equally for attention with you main subject.  it really would have been worth cropping just a millimeter above it.  i like the presence  of the bridge though, it complements in terms of colour, angle, and it helps convey a greater sense of height achieved by the skate boarder.  top half = 9, bottom half = 5, so an average of 7', '2006-08-08 07:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705438, 375580, 57886, '<td valign="top">Good picture and a nice idea to turn it like you did.</td>', 'Good picture and a nice idea to turn it like you did.', '2006-08-08 08:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705439, 375858, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice, if cliched, idea.  hard to guess how this will turn out.  i know this takes a bit of effort, but, the hint of blur really takes away from the shot.  i really doubt if i''ll ever try this (unless, of course, a client is paying for all the bulbs...).</td>', 'nice, if cliched, idea.  hard to guess how this will turn out.  i know this takes a bit of effort, but, the hint of blur really takes away from the shot.  i really doubt if i''ll ever try this (unless, of course, a client is paying for all the bulbs...).', '2006-08-08 08:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705441, 375059, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, don''t like the border, hope the hint of blur doesn''t hold your scores down.  good luck!</td>', 'great idea, don''t like the border, hope the hint of blur doesn''t hold your scores down.  good luck!', '2006-08-08 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
