(2705449, 375435, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome shot!  if you go post your scores in the stop-motion thread, i''m sure everyone else will decide to go on call the challenge done and give you the blue.</td>', 'awesome shot!  if you go post your scores in the stop-motion thread, i''m sure everyone else will decide to go on call the challenge done and give you the blue.', '2006-08-08 08:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
