(2705587, 375591, 16004, '<td valign="top">superb stuff!  colours, composition, the jumpers poncy flash pose, it''s all great.  the grey almost bluescale really works well and adds atmosphere...  the only last thing i might do is clone out the little bird, but it''s not majorly distracting...  excellent.  10.</td>', 'superb stuff!  colours, composition, the jumpers poncy flash pose, it''s all great.  the grey almost bluescale really works well and adds atmosphere...  the only last thing i might do is clone out the little bird, but it''s not majorly distracting...  excellent.  10.', '2006-08-08 09:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705592, 375091, 16004, '<td valign="top">clearly people here have an angewr against the humble light bulb...  i do like the details in this picture; the bright colours in the background is creatively original and rather striking, and the head of the has an interesting aged style.  i like that the focus is on the hammer rather than the bulb.  i''m not sure what the black thing on the left is though; it oddly doesn''t look wrong, but i am spending too much time trying to figure it out...  i like it''s slightly wierdness; 9.</td>', 'clearly people here have an angewr against the humble light bulb...  i do like the details in this picture; the bright colours in the background is creatively original and rather striking, and the head of the has an interesting aged style.  i like that the focus is on the hammer rather than the bulb.  i''m not sure what the black thing on the left is though; it oddly doesn''t look wrong, but i am spending too much time trying to figure it out...  i like it''s slightly wierdness; 9.', '2006-08-08 09:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705598, 375542, 16004, '<td valign="top">ha!  i wonder if this was taken at the same display as the other one?  it''s effectively dramatic, but to me the aircraft feel a little cramped within the frame; i think a bit more sky would be nice.  certainly fits the challenge, and is nice and sharp.  it just lacks a certain something... 6.</td>', 'ha!  i wonder if this was taken at the same display as the other one?  it''s effectively dramatic, but to me the aircraft feel a little cramped within the frame; i think a bit more sky would be nice.  certainly fits the challenge, and is nice and sharp.  it just lacks a certain something... 6.', '2006-08-08 09:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705613, 375803, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to cast a vote on this one.  in terms of fitting the challenge, only the ball is really caught in motion, and it only fills a small percentage of the shot. did you try getting the batter mid-swing?  i don''t know if there''d be much pixel distortion, but i might have been tempted to do a square crop just isolating the top half of the batter, the ball thrower (apologies for naff terminology) and maybe a portion of the crouching bloke.  and it just occured to me that i think it is suffering a little from too much to look at; doing a burn and more of a background blur (which you can do i think in advanced rules) would lessen the distraction from all the cars and stuff...  5.</td>', 'it''s hard to cast a vote on this one.  in terms of fitting the challenge, only the ball is really caught in motion, and it only fills a small percentage of the shot. did you try getting the batter mid-swing?  i don''t know if there''d be much pixel distortion, but i might have been tempted to do a square crop just isolating the top half of the batter, the ball thrower (apologies for naff terminology) and maybe a portion of the crouching bloke.  and it just occured to me that i think it is suffering a little from too much to look at; doing a burn and more of a background blur (which you can do i think in advanced rules) would lessen the distraction from all the cars and stuff...  5.', '2006-08-08 09:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705635, 375892, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s a great capture in terms of timing, but the background is far too messy and visually unappealing.  it''s a big distraction from the action, really.  it''s also a bit of a shame that his arm is obscuring most of his head...  these things do let down what is otherwise a great image; the sense of height (grudgingly heightened by the messy railings!) is really effective.  6.</td>', 'it''s a great capture in terms of timing, but the background is far too messy and visually unappealing.  it''s a big distraction from the action, really.  it''s also a bit of a shame that his arm is obscuring most of his head...  these things do let down what is otherwise a great image; the sense of height (grudgingly heightened by the messy railings!) is really effective.  6.', '2006-08-08 10:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705658, 375463, 3942, '<td valign="top">Great shot, my favourite so far. Very dynamic, perfect cropping. Good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'Great shot, my favourite so far. Very dynamic, perfect cropping. Good luck for the challenge!', '2006-08-08 10:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705662, 374344, 61774, '<td valign="top">I really like the selective coloring on this one, great job!</td>', 'I really like the selective coloring on this one, great job!', '2006-08-08 10:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705669, 375892, 61774, '<td valign="top">It looks like he is floating, great job!</td>', 'It looks like he is floating, great job!', '2006-08-08 10:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705680, 375796, 61774, '<td valign="top">Very nice action shot.</td>', 'Very nice action shot.', '2006-08-08 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705696, 375535, 61774, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and motive.  Looks like it took a while to get this shot...</td>', 'Nice reflection and motive.  Looks like it took a while to get this shot...', '2006-08-08 10:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705701, 375917, 61774, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, nice coloring.</td>', 'Interesting photo, nice coloring.', '2006-08-08 10:31:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2705705, 374959, 61774, '<td valign="top">One of my favs, nice coloring.</td>', 'One of my favs, nice coloring.', '2006-08-08 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705712, 374122, 61774, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid!</td>', 'Very nice candid!', '2006-08-08 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705718, 375707, 16004, '<td valign="top">was it a family outing, then ;)  it''s a nice shot, and not having four in formation does make it stand out.  to a degree, i think less is slightly more, but it feels a bit unreal. not sure why, but there is no sense of movement in this picture.  it''s obvouisly an excellent stopped motion capture, but it feels too still life.  i think the sky might be part of the problem; it''s so perfectly blue yet flat it could almost be a sheet of card behind a suspended model...  6.</td>', 'was it a family outing, then ;)  it''s a nice shot, and not having four in formation does make it stand out.  to a degree, i think less is slightly more, but it feels a bit unreal. not sure why, but there is no sense of movement in this picture.  it''s obvouisly an excellent stopped motion capture, but it feels too still life.  i think the sky might be part of the problem; it''s so perfectly blue yet flat it could almost be a sheet of card behind a suspended model...  6.', '2006-08-08 10:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705763, 375059, 49380, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Awesome composition!</td>', 'Great capture! Awesome composition!', '2006-08-08 10:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705766, 374775, 49380, '<td valign="top">Absoutely awesome! Great colors!</td>', 'Absoutely awesome! Great colors!', '2006-08-08 11:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705768, 374036, 16004, '<td valign="top">i totally adore this picture; i honestly think it''s wonderful.  there is so much style here.  i love the EVER so slightly muted colours, the crop, the EVER so slight grain...  i love the slightly rough feel of it - kind of reminds me of polaroids really.  it has buckets of character.  you know, so many pictures here get processed within an inch of their life, super smooth, overly dodged and burned; icelandicised I suppose. this is so refreshing, power to you and very well done :) 10.</td>', 'i totally adore this picture; i honestly think it''s wonderful.  there is so much style here.  i love the EVER so slightly muted colours, the crop, the EVER so slight grain...  i love the slightly rough feel of it - kind of reminds me of polaroids really.  it has buckets of character.  you know, so many pictures here get processed within an inch of their life, super smooth, overly dodged and burned; icelandicised I suppose. this is so refreshing, power to you and very well done :) 10.', '2006-08-08 11:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705770, 374058, 49380, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this capture! Great clarity and a very interesting subject!</td>', 'Wow, I love this capture! Great clarity and a very interesting subject!', '2006-08-08 11:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705776, 375507, 49380, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture!</td>', 'Wow, great capture!', '2006-08-08 11:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705792, 374344, 57038, '<td valign="top">I personally love picking one or two items to keep in color with everything else b&amp;w.  I would however, suggest zooming in during edit and make sure you have all of the shell selected so you get everything.</td>', 'I personally love picking one or two items to keep in color with everything else b&w.  I would however, suggest zooming in during edit and make sure you have all of the shell selected so you get everything.', '2006-08-08 11:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705841, 374229, 47964, '<td valign="top"><b></b></td>', '', '2006-08-08 11:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705867, 375906, 34759, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon''s a little distracting here. Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.</td>', 'The crooked horizon''s a little distracting here. Otherwise, it''s a nice shot.', '2006-08-08 11:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705923, 375898, 42196, '<td valign="top">Sorry but it just looks too staged.<br/>Maybe I''m wrong but I dont think so.</td>', 'Sorry but it just looks too staged.Maybe I''m wrong but I dont think so.', '2006-08-08 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705942, 375592, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely statue.  Looks like a nice park.  The stopped water looks like ice almost.  ;^)  Technically this image is composed well, the exposure is fine, and I like the bokeh you''re getting in the light thru the trees.  The main think probably holding this back is your choice of subject matter.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely statue.  Looks like a nice park.  The stopped water looks like ice almost.  ;^)  Technically this image is composed well, the exposure is fine, and I like the bokeh you''re getting in the light thru the trees.  The main think probably holding this back is your choice of subject matter.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 12:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705955, 375426, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions in this photo, both guys are seriously concentrating.  Great job capturing that.  You''ve done a nice job framing your subject(s) and you handled the lighting pretty well (tough with sun on dark and light colors).  A little more color saturation could have helped some.  If nothing else, bring up the green/yellows for the grass.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the expressions in this photo, both guys are seriously concentrating.  Great job capturing that.  You''ve done a nice job framing your subject(s) and you handled the lighting pretty well (tough with sun on dark and light colors).  A little more color saturation could have helped some.  If nothing else, bring up the green/yellows for the grass.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 12:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705962, 374970, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job of stopping the motion of the birds wings.  Image seems a bit soft, was this a handheld shot instead of a tripod?  The dark background helps bring out your subject.</td>', 'Nice job of stopping the motion of the birds wings.  Image seems a bit soft, was this a handheld shot instead of a tripod?  The dark background helps bring out your subject.', '2006-08-08 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705968, 375885, 30049, '<td valign="top">The color in this certainly grabs the viewers attention.  Did you use a graduated color filter for this effect?  Nice job of stopping the motion of the swing and the girls dress.  Only nit is it feels slightly underexposed.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The color in this certainly grabs the viewers attention.  Did you use a graduated color filter for this effect?  Nice job of stopping the motion of the swing and the girls dress.  Only nit is it feels slightly underexposed.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 12:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705974, 375813, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  Looking a bit pixelated.  Sizing issue perhaps?  ;^)  Anyway, besides that - the surfer(?) is caught in an interesting pose.  Would like to see it a little closer in.  The colors in this are kind of...drab?  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Uh-oh.  Looking a bit pixelated.  Sizing issue perhaps?  ;^)  Anyway, besides that - the surfer(?) is caught in an interesting pose.  Would like to see it a little closer in.  The colors in this are kind of...drab?  Best of luck to you.', '2006-08-08 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705990, 375507, 57701, '<td valign="top">so elegant!</td>', 'so elegant!', '2006-08-08 12:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705995, 372827, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  This is cool and scary at the same time.  As far as image quality goes, exposure and sharpness are fine.  I might do some cropping left and top (heavier on the left) to getter closer to ROT.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yikes!  This is cool and scary at the same time.  As far as image quality goes, exposure and sharpness are fine.  I might do some cropping left and top (heavier on the left) to getter closer to ROT.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 12:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706007, 375696, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, as long as there isn''t any bubblegum under the coin, you''ve stopped the action.  ;^)  Couple of things going on here.  1) DOF is too shallow IMO for this.  2) Image is noisy, especially the top third.  3) Subject is centered and (nothing personal here) a bit ho-hum.  The reflection on the table is kind of cool.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well, as long as there isn''t any bubblegum under the coin, you''ve stopped the action.  ;^)  Couple of things going on here.  1) DOF is too shallow IMO for this.  2) Image is noisy, especially the top third.  3) Subject is centered and (nothing personal here) a bit ho-hum.  The reflection on the table is kind of cool.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 12:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706016, 374776, 30049, '<td valign="top">You weren''t a Boy Scout were you.  ;^)  Funny idea.  Somehow the split fingers between the index and middle, adds to the image in a good way.  Thumb is a bit tight to the right.  The knive isn''t quite as sharp (no pun intended) as the hand - it''s a little blurry like aperture wasn''t deep enough to get it all in focus.</td>', 'You weren''t a Boy Scout were you.  ;^)  Funny idea.  Somehow the split fingers between the index and middle, adds to the image in a good way.  Thumb is a bit tight to the right.  The knive isn''t quite as sharp (no pun intended) as the hand - it''s a little blurry like aperture wasn''t deep enough to get it all in focus.', '2006-08-08 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706054, 375463, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The diagonal line presented by the biker works well and the flying hat, well that''s just a bonus!  ;^)  Great job on stopping the motion here.  Only thing on the down side for me is the image seems slightly underexposed?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  The diagonal line presented by the biker works well and the flying hat, well that''s just a bonus!  ;^)  Great job on stopping the motion here.  Only thing on the down side for me is the image seems slightly underexposed?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 12:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
