(2706391, 375689, 30049, '<td valign="top">He''s working hard!  ;^)  Cute pic.  Not sure that the theme of Stopped Motion is portrayed well enough here - not on a scale to really see it anyway.</td>', 'He''s working hard!  ;^)  Cute pic.  Not sure that the theme of Stopped Motion is portrayed well enough here - not on a scale to really see it anyway.', '2006-08-08 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706395, 375686, 30049, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought that was snow...it''s water and foam.  Cool!  Very sharp and well done image of this dog.  The water coming off the forefeet really demonstrates the stop motion aspect of this.  B/W was a good choice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first glance I thought that was snow...it''s water and foam.  Cool!  Very sharp and well done image of this dog.  The water coming off the forefeet really demonstrates the stop motion aspect of this.  B/W was a good choice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706400, 374493, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think you should move that cone about 6 inches to the left.   Just kidding.  ;^)  Nice capture of stopped motion.  Kind of with his hand wasn''t missing, and I find the kids in the background distracting a little.</td>', 'I think you should move that cone about 6 inches to the left.   Just kidding.  ;^)  Nice capture of stopped motion.  Kind of with his hand wasn''t missing, and I find the kids in the background distracting a little.', '2006-08-08 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706403, 375707, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s just hanging there.  No smoke, no motion trails, nothing...  Are you sure you weren''t at the museum?  ;^)  Nice crisp image.  Maybe a little static/documentary, but well captured.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like it''s just hanging there.  No smoke, no motion trails, nothing...  Are you sure you weren''t at the museum?  ;^)  Nice crisp image.  Maybe a little static/documentary, but well captured.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706405, 375904, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great capture of stop motion.  Seeing some fringing around the grass blade, and I wish the blue was a little darker (just my preference I know) - but otherwise a nice catch here.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great capture of stop motion.  Seeing some fringing around the grass blade, and I wish the blue was a little darker (just my preference I know) - but otherwise a nice catch here.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706412, 375545, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the hair!  How many times have you heard that?  It''s the first thing I noticed when the image came up.  Cute pic.  Too bad you couldn''t get a nice rooster tail behind the tube or something to add a little punch.  May be a bit underexposed (seems like the whites could be brighter)?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the hair!  How many times have you heard that?  It''s the first thing I noticed when the image came up.  Cute pic.  Too bad you couldn''t get a nice rooster tail behind the tube or something to add a little punch.  May be a bit underexposed (seems like the whites could be brighter)?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706413, 375819, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun photo.  Little blurry, but is a nice addition to the home photo album I''m sure.  Looks like they are all having a good time!  ;^)</td>', 'Fun photo.  Little blurry, but is a nice addition to the home photo album I''m sure.  Looks like they are all having a good time!  ;^)', '2006-08-08 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706417, 374959, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color, very sharp - perhaps a bit overdone on the noise reduction.  Good job of capturing stopped motion.  Love the purple in the bg.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice color, very sharp - perhaps a bit overdone on the noise reduction.  Good job of capturing stopped motion.  Love the purple in the bg.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706421, 375784, 59415, '<td valign="top">It took me several minutes to figure out that she was off the ground.</td>', 'It took me several minutes to figure out that she was off the ground.', '2006-08-08 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706424, 375874, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun event to take photos at.  Pretty good job overall of stopping the motion, the horse especially.  The rider looks a little blurred, but not bad.  Compositionally I think this image would have more impact if there was less space on the left and more on the right.</td>', 'Looks like a fun event to take photos at.  Pretty good job overall of stopping the motion, the horse especially.  The rider looks a little blurred, but not bad.  Compositionally I think this image would have more impact if there was less space on the left and more on the right.', '2006-08-08 14:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706425, 374700, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  How''d you do that?  ;^)  This is fun to look at.  Appears that motion has been stopped - hard to tell without anything to use for context.  Nonetheless, you should do well with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok.  How''d you do that?  ;^)  This is fun to look at.  Appears that motion has been stopped - hard to tell without anything to use for context.  Nonetheless, you should do well with this.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 14:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706427, 373870, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful processing job on this.  Has an oldtime feel to it.  Looks like the noise reduction was a little strong, but hard to tell with water.  So, if I can''t really tell for sure...good job!  ;^)  The background on this works great.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful processing job on this.  Has an oldtime feel to it.  Looks like the noise reduction was a little strong, but hard to tell with water.  So, if I can''t really tell for sure...good job!  ;^)  The background on this works great.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706438, 375759, 30049, '<td valign="top">These are stopped on the rise?  Are these outdoors?  If outdoors, how come the sky is green?  This was a tricky one to attempt.  Looks like you needed a little higher shutter speed to totally stop the motion, especially the bottom third area.  Great idea.  Good luck.</td>', 'These are stopped on the rise?  Are these outdoors?  If outdoors, how come the sky is green?  This was a tricky one to attempt.  Looks like you needed a little higher shutter speed to totally stop the motion, especially the bottom third area.  Great idea.  Good luck.', '2006-08-08 14:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706441, 374977, 30049, '<td valign="top">Minimalist approach works well in this image although I''d wager you''ll get comments on the surfer being too far left. ;^) Nice water spray.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Minimalist approach works well in this image although I''d wager you''ll get comments on the surfer being too far left. ;^) Nice water spray.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706442, 375749, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s so hard to portray fire as being in a stopped motion state.  It probably is, but since there aren''t any hard edges it''s kind of hard to tell.  Hope that makes sense.  Nice job of getting the correct exposure.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s so hard to portray fire as being in a stopped motion state.  It probably is, but since there aren''t any hard edges it''s kind of hard to tell.  Hope that makes sense.  Nice job of getting the correct exposure.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-08 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2706445, 374989, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...pushing it a bit here on meeting the challenge.  Stopped motion is where?  Even if you sell the challenge theme to viewers you are going to take some hits for not having the image level horizontally.  JMO of course.  Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Hmmm...pushing it a bit here on meeting the challenge.  Stopped motion is where?  Even if you sell the challenge theme to viewers you are going to take some hits for not having the image level horizontally.  JMO of course.  Hope it does well for you.', '2006-08-08 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
