(2707571, 375881, 46330, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and sharpness.  I''m not sure I''m 100% sold on the tight crop to the bottom and the right side.</td>', 'Excellent detail and sharpness.  I''m not sure I''m 100% sold on the tight crop to the bottom and the right side.', '2006-08-08 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707585, 375809, 46330, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The vertical format enhances the shot and the judicious use of color keeps the shot feeling clean and uncluttered.</td>', 'Great shot.  The vertical format enhances the shot and the judicious use of color keeps the shot feeling clean and uncluttered.', '2006-08-08 21:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707595, 374700, 46330, '<td valign="top">Superb shot.  I can really see this as an album cover.  Maybe a square crop in keeping with this might be something to consider?</td>', 'Superb shot.  I can really see this as an album cover.  Maybe a square crop in keeping with this might be something to consider?', '2006-08-08 21:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707601, 375784, 46330, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors here but the lack of focus on the runner hurts the overall impact.  It looks like you let the camera pick the focus point and it opted to lock on to the stationary fence between the two women.</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors here but the lack of focus on the runner hurts the overall impact.  It looks like you let the camera pick the focus point and it opted to lock on to the stationary fence between the two women.', '2006-08-08 21:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707617, 375883, 46330, '<td valign="top">When you consider the title it''s somewhat interesting technically to see the stopped motion of the vibrating strings, but as a picture on it''s own I''m afraid there''s really not much to draw in the viewer, especially when you consider how dark and indistinct it is.  You really have to look hard to see more than the highlights on the strings.</td>', 'When you consider the title it''s somewhat interesting technically to see the stopped motion of the vibrating strings, but as a picture on it''s own I''m afraid there''s really not much to draw in the viewer, especially when you consider how dark and indistinct it is.  You really have to look hard to see more than the highlights on the strings.', '2006-08-08 21:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
