(2707828, 375420, 46330, '<td valign="top">Motion is stopped, but it''s hard to tell what it is without the title, and the amputated foot in the upper right just confuses the composition further.</td>', 'Motion is stopped, but it''s hard to tell what it is without the title, and the amputated foot in the upper right just confuses the composition further.', '2006-08-08 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707830, 375809, 57886, '<td valign="top">OMG the things we do for a good picture... LOL, this is actually a great picture. Could even be better if the contrast btwn the subject and background would be more??? But, very good :o)</td>', 'OMG the things we do for a good picture... LOL, this is actually a great picture. Could even be better if the contrast btwn the subject and background would be more??? But, very good :o)', '2006-08-08 22:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707835, 375465, 45475, '<td valign="top">Despite the blurring along her arms, this is an exceptional image. The DoF, tones, mood, model, everything is beautiful. Nicely captured, 10.</td>', 'Despite the blurring along her arms, this is an exceptional image. The DoF, tones, mood, model, everything is beautiful. Nicely captured, 10.', '2006-08-08 22:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707837, 374205, 46330, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, but the colors seem rather flat and highlights are blown out.  The bright white invariably draws the eye away from the main subject, in this case, the people in the raft.</td>', 'Composition is good, but the colors seem rather flat and highlights are blown out.  The bright white invariably draws the eye away from the main subject, in this case, the people in the raft.', '2006-08-08 22:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707838, 375441, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hope you did not really shoot him :o) Good idea, wish the "fire" would not look so.... I don´t wan´t to say fake because I am sure it isn´t, but sometimes things that are real do not look real... Anyhow, it will get an 8 from me, would give it more if the colors were better, but... good luck.</td>', 'Hope you did not really shoot him :o) Good idea, wish the "fire" would not look so.... I don´t wan´t to say fake because I am sure it isn´t, but sometimes things that are real do not look real... Anyhow, it will get an 8 from me, would give it more if the colors were better, but... good luck.', '2006-08-08 22:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707840, 374870, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gotta love it, it''s what this challenge is all about. Brilliant timing. Like what the fill flash does to this. 10</td>', 'Gotta love it, it''s what this challenge is all about. Brilliant timing. Like what the fill flash does to this. 10', '2006-08-08 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707844, 374375, 57886, '<td valign="top">Clear and bright with nice colors...</td>', 'Clear and bright with nice colors...', '2006-08-08 22:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707847, 375379, 46330, '<td valign="top">I actually rather like the composition and colors here, but the water from the pipes really doesn''t serve any purpose in the photo, other than to fit it into the challenge.  Maybe it would add more if you froze it as it hit the pool and splashed instead of in mid air?</td>', 'I actually rather like the composition and colors here, but the water from the pipes really doesn''t serve any purpose in the photo, other than to fit it into the challenge.  Maybe it would add more if you froze it as it hit the pool and splashed instead of in mid air?', '2006-08-08 22:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
