(2707886, 375814, 46330, '<td valign="top">The composition is good with the deer running into the frame and I always like the blur effect associated with panning but the deer is just not sharp enough.</td>', 'The composition is good with the deer running into the frame and I always like the blur effect associated with panning but the deer is just not sharp enough.', '2006-08-08 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
