(2710023, 374558, 16004, '<td valign="top">i only just watched this the other night, and yes, you''ve captured the Fincher style exactly (though, there can only be one fight a time, naturally).  the slightly muted, gently brown tinted colours works very effectively.  a brutal and evocative picture, fantastically staged and taken; 10.</td>', 'i only just watched this the other night, and yes, you''ve captured the Fincher style exactly (though, there can only be one fight a time, naturally).  the slightly muted, gently brown tinted colours works very effectively.  a brutal and evocative picture, fantastically staged and taken; 10.', '2006-08-09 09:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710041, 375873, 33379, '<td valign="top">great model, very cute and creative. good luck, should score high!</td>', 'great model, very cute and creative. good luck, should score high!', '2006-08-09 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710061, 374229, 33379, '<td valign="top">i wish you wouldve had her head in the photo, at least i wouldve liked it better. colors are good,action is good. but i''m knocking off 2 points for the absent head, 8.</td>', 'i wish you wouldve had her head in the photo, at least i wouldve liked it better. colors are good,action is good. but i''m knocking off 2 points for the absent head, 8.', '2006-08-09 10:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710077, 374295, 33379, '<td valign="top">i''m not seeing an implied sense of stopped motion</td>', 'i''m not seeing an implied sense of stopped motion', '2006-08-09 10:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710104, 374870, 33379, '<td valign="top">wow, thats an amazing capture. you gotta win, good luck!</td>', 'wow, thats an amazing capture. you gotta win, good luck!', '2006-08-09 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710172, 375907, 33379, '<td valign="top">i dont know how to vote on this photo because it looks awesome, but i dont get the sense of stopped motion. Since its fluid it must have motion, but is it so thick it barely moves? hmmm...well after thinking it over I must give you the best score. The fluid looks so silky. Very Well Done. Good Luck!</td>', 'i dont know how to vote on this photo because it looks awesome, but i dont get the sense of stopped motion. Since its fluid it must have motion, but is it so thick it barely moves? hmmm...well after thinking it over I must give you the best score. The fluid looks so silky. Very Well Done. Good Luck!', '2006-08-09 10:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710247, 375580, 3102, '<td valign="top">Sure, I''ve seen this done before, but you pulled this one off tremendously.  You could easily submit this to a newspaper as a feature photo on a hot day.</td>', 'Sure, I''ve seen this done before, but you pulled this one off tremendously.  You could easily submit this to a newspaper as a feature photo on a hot day.', '2006-08-09 10:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710265, 375873, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite possibly a ribbon winner -- very well executed!</td>', 'Quite possibly a ribbon winner -- very well executed!', '2006-08-09 11:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710300, 374229, 3102, '<td valign="top">It feels awfully awkward with her head chopped off.</td>', 'It feels awfully awkward with her head chopped off.', '2006-08-09 11:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710309, 375696, 16004, '<td valign="top">cor!  too much colour noise, purple fringing and grain on this, probably artefacts left over from a high ISO setting... i do sympathise; if indeed it was moving (though, to be honest, it looks like it might be resting on a bit of blu-tak underneath) i would imagine getting a stop motion effect at a macro scale to be a right sod. must say, the table surface is not a good choice for this sort of shot either; a piece of white glossy photo paper would probably improve things...  3.</td>', 'cor!  too much colour noise, purple fringing and grain on this, probably artefacts left over from a high ISO setting... i do sympathise; if indeed it was moving (though, to be honest, it looks like it might be resting on a bit of blu-tak underneath) i would imagine getting a stop motion effect at a macro scale to be a right sod. must say, the table surface is not a good choice for this sort of shot either; a piece of white glossy photo paper would probably improve things...  3.', '2006-08-09 11:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710344, 374700, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot -- I''ll be interested in reading the details of how you did this one!</td>', 'Very cool shot -- I''ll be interested in reading the details of how you did this one!', '2006-08-09 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710605, 375441, 57714, '<td valign="top">I think "Enough" would be an appropriate title.  The man has an angry abusive look and the gun is being held by a woman; she''s finally had enough and fighting back.  Not very realistic though.  The woman clearly has never shot a gun before.  She''d probably beak some part of her wrist that way.  I like the flame look, but not realistic.  I''d love to know how you put this together.  -7</td>', 'I think "Enough" would be an appropriate title.  The man has an angry abusive look and the gun is being held by a woman; she''s finally had enough and fighting back.  Not very realistic though.  The woman clearly has never shot a gun before.  She''d probably beak some part of her wrist that way.  I like the flame look, but not realistic.  I''d love to know how you put this together.  -7', '2006-08-09 12:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710682, 375771, 40088, '<td valign="top">nice perspective, good b/w and a nice touch of color, very well executed, the idea I had in mind with this challenge.</td>', 'nice perspective, good b/w and a nice touch of color, very well executed, the idea I had in mind with this challenge.', '2006-08-09 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710693, 375816, 40088, '<td valign="top">love the grain and the red/blue contrast very much, border fits the picture really good</td>', 'love the grain and the red/blue contrast very much, border fits the picture really good', '2006-08-09 12:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710851, 374558, 45754, '<td valign="top">Well staged. Good job.</td>', 'Well staged. Good job.', '2006-08-09 13:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710942, 375474, 51802, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  It looks like the driver is making eye contact with you!  It would help a lot if the front of the go-cart were not cropped off.</td>', 'Nice capture.  It looks like the driver is making eye contact with you!  It would help a lot if the front of the go-cart were not cropped off.', '2006-08-09 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710949, 375041, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but you might want to cut back on the sharpening to avoid the pronounced edge halo.</td>', 'Nice capture, but you might want to cut back on the sharpening to avoid the pronounced edge halo.', '2006-08-09 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710951, 375274, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but you might want to cut back on the sharpening to avoid the pronounced edge halo.</td>', 'Nice capture, but you might want to cut back on the sharpening to avoid the pronounced edge halo.', '2006-08-09 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2710990, 375614, 61006, '<td valign="top">Heh I laughed when I saw this. Looks pretty sexy actually. Great shot! :)</td>', 'Heh I laughed when I saw this. Looks pretty sexy actually. Great shot! :)', '2006-08-09 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711008, 375426, 61006, '<td valign="top">Haha! I love how the guy with the ball looks all concentrated and the other guy is just like ''Oh my god!''. Great title too, it actually does look like it''s glued to his foot. Hehe! Awesome shot.</td>', 'Haha! I love how the guy with the ball looks all concentrated and the other guy is just like ''Oh my god!''. Great title too, it actually does look like it''s glued to his foot. Hehe! Awesome shot.', '2006-08-09 14:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711115, 375894, 62685, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2006-08-09 14:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711273, 375722, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Makes me wonder what kid of studio you have that you are firing shots in there!  LOL.  Anyway, a great stopped motion shot, executed with precision.  I like the fact that most of the bulb is yet intact, and you can tell the bullet hasn''t done it''s full damage yet, but has only just tapped the outer edge of the glass at this point.  I love the tiny tiny shards that are in this.  The only distraction are some of the room reflections in the bulb, but then again, maybe it gives it some elements of interest.  Anyway, I gave you a 7 originally, upping it to an 8, because you just deserve it!</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Makes me wonder what kid of studio you have that you are firing shots in there!  LOL.  Anyway, a great stopped motion shot, executed with precision.  I like the fact that most of the bulb is yet intact, and you can tell the bullet hasn''t done it''s full damage yet, but has only just tapped the outer edge of the glass at this point.  I love the tiny tiny shards that are in this.  The only distraction are some of the room reflections in the bulb, but then again, maybe it gives it some elements of interest.  Anyway, I gave you a 7 originally, upping it to an 8, because you just deserve it!', '2006-08-09 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711278, 374700, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  A very fun shot.  It is very simple, but who needs alot of distraction from the real subject in a shot anyway, right?  <br/> <br/>The blues are GORGEOUS!  There is something about the coloring of the person that I just don''t care for, but it is probably your intent (I don''t know how that''s done, maybe desaturated?)  Anyway, it doesn''t really take away from this shot by any means.  <br/> <br/>I gave you an 8.</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  A very fun shot.  It is very simple, but who needs alot of distraction from the real subject in a shot anyway, right?   The blues are GORGEOUS!  There is something about the coloring of the person that I just don''t care for, but it is probably your intent (I don''t know how that''s done, maybe desaturated?)  Anyway, it doesn''t really take away from this shot by any means.   I gave you an 8.', '2006-08-09 15:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711281, 374558, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Okay.  This is hard to comment on, as who likes violence?  Because I don''t like violence, it''s hard to look at it.  BUT.  I''m going to try to separate myself from that feeling, and try to judge this.  It is a very well executed shot.  The perspective is wonderful, with the tilt of the camera seeming to get into the action.  The waterflow (or is that blood, yuck!), coming from the mouth of the victim in the foreground is very good.  It is very realistic, maybe that is why I struggle with this.  The details are all there for this one.  Even the hair looks like he''s been in a sweaty brawl!  The background pair adds interest to this shot, and thank God, it takes my attention away from that poor soul in the foreground!  The use of color is great, somewhat tonal, and the use of lighting is nice as well.  It deserves higher than the 8 that I gave you, so I am upping this to a 9, but reluctantly because of the subject matter.  I won''t deny it''s creativity and originality by keeping your score lower than it deserves.  You are actually pretty courageous for this shot.</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Okay.  This is hard to comment on, as who likes violence?  Because I don''t like violence, it''s hard to look at it.  BUT.  I''m going to try to separate myself from that feeling, and try to judge this.  It is a very well executed shot.  The perspective is wonderful, with the tilt of the camera seeming to get into the action.  The waterflow (or is that blood, yuck!), coming from the mouth of the victim in the foreground is very good.  It is very realistic, maybe that is why I struggle with this.  The details are all there for this one.  Even the hair looks like he''s been in a sweaty brawl!  The background pair adds interest to this shot, and thank God, it takes my attention away from that poor soul in the foreground!  The use of color is great, somewhat tonal, and the use of lighting is nice as well.  It deserves higher than the 8 that I gave you, so I am upping this to a 9, but reluctantly because of the subject matter.  I won''t deny it''s creativity and originality by keeping your score lower than it deserves.  You are actually pretty courageous for this shot.', '2006-08-09 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711284, 375885, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Wow.  I hardly know where to begin.  So, I guess anywhere is a good place.  The background.  Extraordinary use of color.  Eye-popping color.  The subject.  Very well executed, and a very sweet and sentimental subject.  The position of the subject in the shot is a nice touch, coming from the upper left, moving downward and toward the center of the canvas.  The whispery feeling of the girl''s dress, and the way it fades away into the color is a very nice addition.  The ONLY little thing that I find distracting to the softness of this photo is the boots on the girl.  They just don''t fit the overall mood of the shot.  A small distraction, but something I feel.  I don''t know if barefoot, or a simple sandal with clean lines would have been better, and less distracting.  This sounds like a fasion comment now, LOL.  Anyway, I''m upping your photo from an 8 to a 9 after a second glance.  The boots is what keeps me from giving it a 10.  Definately a beauty tho!</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Wow.  I hardly know where to begin.  So, I guess anywhere is a good place.  The background.  Extraordinary use of color.  Eye-popping color.  The subject.  Very well executed, and a very sweet and sentimental subject.  The position of the subject in the shot is a nice touch, coming from the upper left, moving downward and toward the center of the canvas.  The whispery feeling of the girl''s dress, and the way it fades away into the color is a very nice addition.  The ONLY little thing that I find distracting to the softness of this photo is the boots on the girl.  They just don''t fit the overall mood of the shot.  A small distraction, but something I feel.  I don''t know if barefoot, or a simple sandal with clean lines would have been better, and less distracting.  This sounds like a fasion comment now, LOL.  Anyway, I''m upping your photo from an 8 to a 9 after a second glance.  The boots is what keeps me from giving it a 10.  Definately a beauty tho!', '2006-08-09 15:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711287, 375710, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  A very well executed shot.  I enjoy looking at this, it makes me want to head to the kitchen to get the sauce going.  The lighting and use of color in this is very nice.  It is very clear and sharp.  The little props around the window and sink add lots of interest.  I wish there was a little more tossing of the pasta here.  There''s a whole bowl of the pasta to throw in the air, but this only has a few pieces.  Anyway, I can see this shot hanging in a kitchen, of course, but also could be in a restaraunt, or department store in their kitchenware section!  Upping my original 7 after taking a second, longer look.  Giving you a 9.  It would be a 10, except for the lack of pasta in the air.  Next time, just give it a good toss!</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  A very well executed shot.  I enjoy looking at this, it makes me want to head to the kitchen to get the sauce going.  The lighting and use of color in this is very nice.  It is very clear and sharp.  The little props around the window and sink add lots of interest.  I wish there was a little more tossing of the pasta here.  There''s a whole bowl of the pasta to throw in the air, but this only has a few pieces.  Anyway, I can see this shot hanging in a kitchen, of course, but also could be in a restaraunt, or department store in their kitchenware section!  Upping my original 7 after taking a second, longer look.  Giving you a 9.  It would be a 10, except for the lack of pasta in the air.  Next time, just give it a good toss!', '2006-08-09 15:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711291, 375257, 60379, '<td valign="top">"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Great use of color, both in the background and in the subject.  Great movement in the running water, and the little splashes that are happening all over this shot.  I gave you a 9.  Not a 10 because I found the dirty hands a little distracting.  Even though I''m sure your attempt was to show a freshly picked apple, that just kinda bugged me.  But a 9 is good right?  LOL.</td>', '"Great Job" from the "Great Job Baggie"!  Great use of color, both in the background and in the subject.  Great movement in the running water, and the little splashes that are happening all over this shot.  I gave you a 9.  Not a 10 because I found the dirty hands a little distracting.  Even though I''m sure your attempt was to show a freshly picked apple, that just kinda bugged me.  But a 9 is good right?  LOL.', '2006-08-09 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711429, 374738, 10867, '<td valign="top">This might have been even more suitable for the From the Ground Up challenge.</td>', 'This might have been even more suitable for the From the Ground Up challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711434, 375917, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  I like the sepia tone to it and the range is good.  The subject is entertaining and fun to look at.  Motion has certainly been stopped as required for the challenge.  You will probably hear a complaint or two about the shadow on his face.  Overall this should do well, but voters can be fickle.  Not sure if the subject has enough ''Wow'' to break the top 20 - I hope it does.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a nice image.  I like the sepia tone to it and the range is good.  The subject is entertaining and fun to look at.  Motion has certainly been stopped as required for the challenge.  You will probably hear a complaint or two about the shadow on his face.  Overall this should do well, but voters can be fickle.  Not sure if the subject has enough ''Wow'' to break the top 20 - I hope it does.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711439, 375916, 30049, '<td valign="top">The motion is stopped ok.  Image is interesting enough to look at, although I think your primary subject(s) are too distant to make a big impact on the voters.  JMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'The motion is stopped ok.  Image is interesting enough to look at, although I think your primary subject(s) are too distant to make a big impact on the voters.  JMO.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711441, 375873, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  I hope there''s not some major trickery going on here or I''ll be disappointed. ;^)  However you did it, it works.  Fun to look at.  Motion is certainly stopped.  Overall very clear and sharp (pink ice cream is on the edge).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very clever.  I hope there''s not some major trickery going on here or I''ll be disappointed. ;^)  However you did it, it works.  Fun to look at.  Motion is certainly stopped.  Overall very clear and sharp (pink ice cream is on the edge).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:25:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2711445, 375824, 30049, '<td valign="top">So hard to completely freeze a hummingbirds wings.   Close here, but not quite.  A little blur going on in the body area also.  Good catch overall however.  ;^)</td>', 'So hard to completely freeze a hummingbirds wings.   Close here, but not quite.  A little blur going on in the body area also.  Good catch overall however.  ;^)', '2006-08-09 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711451, 375474, 30049, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  They won.  Yaaaa.  ;^)  Nice capture of the moment.  Not sure that the shutter speed was quite fast enough...or there was a little camera shake, but the image seems a bit soft, not quite sharp.  Nonetheless, I hope you do well with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Woohoo!  They won.  Yaaaa.  ;^)  Nice capture of the moment.  Not sure that the shutter speed was quite fast enough...or there was a little camera shake, but the image seems a bit soft, not quite sharp.  Nonetheless, I hope you do well with this.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711458, 375257, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks vaguely familiar.  The image is sharp, well composed, and the motion is stopped - so you should be ok.  Good luck.</td>', 'This looks vaguely familiar.  The image is sharp, well composed, and the motion is stopped - so you should be ok.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711463, 375799, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool shot overall.  Bit static/documentary feeling.  Yes, the motion is certainly stopped.  Little bit soft and grainy.  I don''t know, something''s missing to make this image pop.  Wish I could say what...sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool shot overall.  Bit static/documentary feeling.  Yes, the motion is certainly stopped.  Little bit soft and grainy.  I don''t know, something''s missing to make this image pop.  Wish I could say what...sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711472, 375645, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you''re getting some comments on this one!  ;^)  Your belly is on fire.  Your head is smoking.  ;^)  The little soccer player looks happy enough.</td>', 'I''ll bet you''re getting some comments on this one!  ;^)  Your belly is on fire.  Your head is smoking.  ;^)  The little soccer player looks happy enough.', '2006-08-09 16:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711481, 375703, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  Didn''t stop those blades from turning.  ;^)  Image is well focused and exposed - just not quite fast enough on the shutter speed for a challenge with the theme of ''Stopped Motion'' with the caveat of no motion trails.  Cool looking plane tho.  ;^)</td>', 'Uh-oh.  Didn''t stop those blades from turning.  ;^)  Image is well focused and exposed - just not quite fast enough on the shutter speed for a challenge with the theme of ''Stopped Motion'' with the caveat of no motion trails.  Cool looking plane tho.  ;^)', '2006-08-09 16:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711488, 375829, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun.  I like the water trails, and the smile on her face.  If nothing else you had fun getting this image, although I hope you kept your camera equipment dry!  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is fun.  I like the water trails, and the smile on her face.  If nothing else you had fun getting this image, although I hope you kept your camera equipment dry!  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711491, 375620, 30049, '<td valign="top">Stopped the motion just fine.  Cool shadow on the wall.  ;^)  Lighting is a little harsh, but not bad.  The night sky helps give this image some added dimension.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Stopped the motion just fine.  Cool shadow on the wall.  ;^)  Lighting is a little harsh, but not bad.  The night sky helps give this image some added dimension.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711508, 375274, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but a bit "flat".</td>', 'Nice capture but a bit "flat".', '2006-08-09 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711521, 375647, 45790, '<td valign="top">Funny! Seems to be an ugly green tinge to everything -- is white balance correct?</td>', 'Funny! Seems to be an ugly green tinge to everything -- is white balance correct?', '2006-08-09 16:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711525, 375435, 45790, '<td valign="top">One word -- wow!</td>', 'One word -- wow!', '2006-08-09 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711529, 374870, 45790, '<td valign="top">I love his expression! Good sharp picture, well lit.</td>', 'I love his expression! Good sharp picture, well lit.', '2006-08-09 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711535, 375913, 45790, '<td valign="top">This really looks like a disaster in the making. I hope there were no injuries!</td>', 'This really looks like a disaster in the making. I hope there were no injuries!', '2006-08-09 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711540, 373501, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful image.  I think you''re probably going to take a minor hit for the difficulty factor.  JMO of course.  Very nice color and I like the background bokeh.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very beautiful image.  I think you''re probably going to take a minor hit for the difficulty factor.  JMO of course.  Very nice color and I like the background bokeh.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711541, 374229, 45790, '<td valign="top">I can understand why you would cut off the head to show the motion, but I think that isn''t desirable here. I''m also distracted by the busy background.</td>', 'I can understand why you would cut off the head to show the motion, but I think that isn''t desirable here. I''m also distracted by the busy background.', '2006-08-09 16:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711548, 375580, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great capture, use of the curve pattern, colors, clever use of 90 degree rotation. Superb!</td>', 'Great capture, use of the curve pattern, colors, clever use of 90 degree rotation. Superb!', '2006-08-09 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711549, 374084, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  That''s pretty cool!  Haven''t seen an image like this here yet, and I''ve been here a while now.  Plenty of pool table shots but not a jump shot.  Clever idea.  Now...how''s it doing I wonder?  Exposure and color temp are good for an indoor lighting shot.  Have the stopped motion portion taken care of.  Only nit is the line of the table against the background makes it look slanted to the right.  Might hear about that.  Anyway...best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey!  That''s pretty cool!  Haven''t seen an image like this here yet, and I''ve been here a while now.  Plenty of pool table shots but not a jump shot.  Clever idea.  Now...how''s it doing I wonder?  Exposure and color temp are good for an indoor lighting shot.  Have the stopped motion portion taken care of.  Only nit is the line of the table against the background makes it look slanted to the right.  Might hear about that.  Anyway...best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711555, 374947, 30049, '<td valign="top">Handsome dog.  Great grass you''re growing there.  ;^)  Unfortunately the dog is a little blurry and based on the grass being in focus I''m thinking it''s from motion blur.  Not going to go over well with voters when ''Stopped Motion'' is the theme.  :(  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Handsome dog.  Great grass you''re growing there.  ;^)  Unfortunately the dog is a little blurry and based on the grass being in focus I''m thinking it''s from motion blur.  Not going to go over well with voters when ''Stopped Motion'' is the theme.  :(  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711557, 375892, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool move.  Too bad there is SO much going on in the background.</td>', 'That''s a cool move.  Too bad there is SO much going on in the background.', '2006-08-09 16:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711562, 374600, 30049, '<td valign="top">Trampolines are great for photo op''s aren''t they?  ;^)  Most of the time it''s good to have broody looking clouds.  For this it would have been nice to have more blue sky.  Not that you can control it I know...  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  The boy''s face looks a little blurry/soft.  Good luck.</td>', 'Trampolines are great for photo op''s aren''t they?  ;^)  Most of the time it''s good to have broody looking clouds.  For this it would have been nice to have more blue sky.  Not that you can control it I know...  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  The boy''s face looks a little blurry/soft.  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 16:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711563, 375645, 45790, '<td valign="top">The sun draws attention to the belly. Different camera positioning would have made a big difference to this pleasant father-son (I''d guess) shot.</td>', 'The sun draws attention to the belly. Different camera positioning would have made a big difference to this pleasant father-son (I''d guess) shot.', '2006-08-09 16:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711566, 375902, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is pretty clear.  Stopped Motion is working with this.  Nice color in the water.  Only down point for me is the image seems a bit underexposed.  Try adjusting the levels or hit the histogram adjustment a little and see how it looks.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is pretty clear.  Stopped Motion is working with this.  Nice color in the water.  Only down point for me is the image seems a bit underexposed.  Try adjusting the levels or hit the histogram adjustment a little and see how it looks.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-09 17:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711571, 375814, 45790, '<td valign="top">Glad to see someone not overly influenced by Disney''s Bambi. Unfortunately the thief is a bit blurred.</td>', 'Glad to see someone not overly influenced by Disney''s Bambi. Unfortunately the thief is a bit blurred.', '2006-08-09 17:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711573, 375274, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  Little too blurry in the final output however.  Even the people in the background show some blur.  Camera being handheld, yes?  Also, this is underexposed a little, or at least it appears to be (could be this work monitor).  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'Clever idea.  Little too blurry in the final output however.  Even the people in the background show some blur.  Camera being handheld, yes?  Also, this is underexposed a little, or at least it appears to be (could be this work monitor).  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 17:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711577, 373501, 45790, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Lots of color.</td>', 'Lovely! Lots of color.', '2006-08-09 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711580, 375895, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thing that jumps out at me is the shadow on the hammer handle.  You''ve stopped the motion of the bulb breaking just fine.  The hammer head is good and crisp.  The lower part of the handle looks blurry but I think that''s a DOF thing.  Lighting is good.  Should do well with this if the voters aren''t tired of this subject.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'First thing that jumps out at me is the shadow on the hammer handle.  You''ve stopped the motion of the bulb breaking just fine.  The hammer head is good and crisp.  The lower part of the handle looks blurry but I think that''s a DOF thing.  Lighting is good.  Should do well with this if the voters aren''t tired of this subject.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-09 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2711584, 375754, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Wish it wasn''t so grainy.  Did you use a high ISO setting or something to use the natural lighting?  Future Olympian?  ;^)</td>', 'Cute.  Wish it wasn''t so grainy.  Did you use a high ISO setting or something to use the natural lighting?  Future Olympian?  ;^)', '2006-08-09 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
