(2712931, 375411, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion, but you need to use the full 640 pixels on the longest side to let us really see the picture.  There''s a tutorial in the "Learn" section to help you do this.  A bit flat in contrast - a touch of levels would bring out the details, pop the colors.</td>', 'Good stop motion, but you need to use the full 640 pixels on the longest side to let us really see the picture.  There''s a tutorial in the "Learn" section to help you do this.  A bit flat in contrast - a touch of levels would bring out the details, pop the colors.', '2006-08-09 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2712938, 375809, 30982, '<td valign="top">Best tell me no fish were harmed in the making of this shot!  Well done, but I am worried about the fish...</td>', 'Best tell me no fish were harmed in the making of this shot!  Well done, but I am worried about the fish...', '2006-08-09 23:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
