(2713191, 374422, 62637, '<td valign="top">Another chopper shooter!  Big machine, makes the 500D I run around in look like a mini!  Is that a female pilot??<br/> <br/>Anyway, as someone who takes alot of pics of choppers, I know how difficult it is to capture them; job well done.  However, itd be nice to have the whole chopper in the shot.  Otherwise, good job on a shot that looks like it was taken in less than ideal conditions.</td>', 'Another chopper shooter!  Big machine, makes the 500D I run around in look like a mini!  Is that a female pilot?? Anyway, as someone who takes alot of pics of choppers, I know how difficult it is to capture them; job well done.  However, itd be nice to have the whole chopper in the shot.  Otherwise, good job on a shot that looks like it was taken in less than ideal conditions.', '2006-08-10 00:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
