(2713606, 375703, 48560, '<td valign="top">nice big red!<br/>loyal to the challenge topic of being "frozen motion" here.<br/>the plane appears immobile if the properllers aren''t in motion. Cool.</td>', 'nice big red!loyal to the challenge topic of being "frozen motion" here.the plane appears immobile if the properllers aren''t in motion. Cool.', '2006-08-10 03:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713610, 375894, 48560, '<td valign="top">wow. It is interesting to see the way the water is frozen in motion.<br/>You did great capturing the swimmer at this position - it is always too fast when they do it in real life. nice shot.</td>', 'wow. It is interesting to see the way the water is frozen in motion.You did great capturing the swimmer at this position - it is always too fast when they do it in real life. nice shot.', '2006-08-10 03:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713652, 375573, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like this shot on a few levels:<br/>the pose of the footballer<br/>his natural expression<br/>the overal colour of this photo<br/>the clouds and the sky, the sun light<br/>the sharp focus of the background (good deep DOF!)<br/>the crispness of the subject and ball.<br/>aww man... good work!</td>', 'I like this shot on a few levels:the pose of the footballerhis natural expressionthe overal colour of this photothe clouds and the sky, the sun lightthe sharp focus of the background (good deep DOF!)the crispness of the subject and ball.aww man... good work!', '2006-08-10 04:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713666, 375885, 48560, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the colours, but<br/>I like the subject because it holds my interest.<br/>I like how "empty" the photo looks like (good use of negative space)</td>', 'I don''t like the colours, butI like the subject because it holds my interest.I like how "empty" the photo looks like (good use of negative space)', '2006-08-10 04:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713676, 375648, 48560, '<td valign="top">The standing guy in the front really makes the picture.</td>', 'The standing guy in the front really makes the picture.', '2006-08-10 04:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713696, 375507, 48560, '<td valign="top">wonderful.<br/>i like the light shining through their wings and feathers.<br/>very beautiful photo (and title)</td>', 'wonderful.i like the light shining through their wings and feathers.very beautiful photo (and title)', '2006-08-10 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713698, 373328, 48560, '<td valign="top">striking colours - i like those!<br/>very sharp focus too.</td>', 'striking colours - i like those!very sharp focus too.', '2006-08-10 04:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713701, 375809, 19959, '<td valign="top">Wow. This has got to be top3 (Which is a shame as my effort will now not ribbon (IMO) as I have seen at least two other contenders for top 3. This should blue or red.</td>', 'Wow. This has got to be top3 (Which is a shame as my effort will now not ribbon (IMO) as I have seen at least two other contenders for top 3. This should blue or red.', '2006-08-10 04:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713702, 375584, 19959, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little too tight. But this is a nice capture.</td>', 'The crop is a little too tight. But this is a nice capture.', '2006-08-10 04:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713703, 374058, 19959, '<td valign="top">Good effort. I like the idea. The glass is slightly tilted which is a shame, also perhaps a shot from level with the rim might have worked better. Overall though really nicely done.</td>', 'Good effort. I like the idea. The glass is slightly tilted which is a shame, also perhaps a shot from level with the rim might have worked better. Overall though really nicely done.', '2006-08-10 04:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713707, 375809, 48560, '<td valign="top">looks very convincing, that I actually wondered how this is set up.<br/>Very good work, and I like the bright light and overall clean appearance of this amazing shot.</td>', 'looks very convincing, that I actually wondered how this is set up.Very good work, and I like the bright light and overall clean appearance of this amazing shot.', '2006-08-10 04:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713709, 374999, 48560, '<td valign="top">a very good motion panning shot!</td>', 'a very good motion panning shot!', '2006-08-10 04:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713712, 375465, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The lady stands out and really captures my attention.</td>', 'I like this photo. The lady stands out and really captures my attention.', '2006-08-10 05:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713715, 375829, 48560, '<td valign="top">cute, and I like her mischievous laughter there.<br/>Hope no camera was harmed in the process (just kidding!)<br/>great fun photo here. Nice!</td>', 'cute, and I like her mischievous laughter there.Hope no camera was harmed in the process (just kidding!)great fun photo here. Nice!', '2006-08-10 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713719, 375885, 41337, '<td valign="top">Where''s the cowboy hat? :P</td>', 'Where''s the cowboy hat? :P', '2006-08-10 05:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713737, 375773, 41337, '<td valign="top">I typically find these shots rather boring because usually the only "wow" factor present is the mere timing of the shot and nothing else. However here this image can stand on it''s own for purely artistic reasons. The composition is great as is the lighting and of course you nailed the stop motion but best of all it''s simply a nice looking image to look at. I''m bumping this up from a 7 to a 10. Good luck.</td>', 'I typically find these shots rather boring because usually the only "wow" factor present is the mere timing of the shot and nothing else. However here this image can stand on it''s own for purely artistic reasons. The composition is great as is the lighting and of course you nailed the stop motion but best of all it''s simply a nice looking image to look at. I''m bumping this up from a 7 to a 10. Good luck.', '2006-08-10 05:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713747, 375087, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a cute candid shot, that has character.  i especially like the high contrast and colours of the lad with a paler slightly washed out shades of the surroundings.  i feel the composition is a bit off though, feeling neither centred or set to one side a la rule of thirds.  regards to the challenge, i feel that the stopped motion is a bit inconsequential (it would look very similar and just as good on a slightly longer exposure), but it does still fit.   but overall this is an immediately likeable shot, and a good example of a city life candid shot.  7.</td>', 'this is a cute candid shot, that has character.  i especially like the high contrast and colours of the lad with a paler slightly washed out shades of the surroundings.  i feel the composition is a bit off though, feeling neither centred or set to one side a la rule of thirds.  regards to the challenge, i feel that the stopped motion is a bit inconsequential (it would look very similar and just as good on a slightly longer exposure), but it does still fit.   but overall this is an immediately likeable shot, and a good example of a city life candid shot.  7.', '2006-08-10 05:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713763, 375411, 16004, '<td valign="top">too dark, i''m afraid.  a quick dabble with the brightness and contrast, or levels (or curves if you''ve got them) would really bring out the colours and make this stand out in a more immediate wow! kind of way.  it also looks a bit small; it''s always best to get as big as you can for greater impact. 4.</td>', 'too dark, i''m afraid.  a quick dabble with the brightness and contrast, or levels (or curves if you''ve got them) would really bring out the colours and make this stand out in a more immediate wow! kind of way.  it also looks a bit small; it''s always best to get as big as you can for greater impact. 4.', '2006-08-10 06:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713773, 375580, 55773, '<td valign="top">Great catpure, cool composition.</td>', 'Great catpure, cool composition.', '2006-08-10 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713774, 375655, 55773, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit of noise/grain around the face. Nonetheless, a good picture.</td>', 'Seems to be a bit of noise/grain around the face. Nonetheless, a good picture.', '2006-08-10 06:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713776, 375676, 55773, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, although I am not usually inclined to likeing center compositions, I think this however works really well.</td>', 'Fantastic, although I am not usually inclined to likeing center compositions, I think this however works really well.', '2006-08-10 06:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713780, 375620, 55773, '<td valign="top">Even after reading more than a few skateboarding magazines myself, this definently beats some of their photography. I hope this is voted decently, because it is a lot more difficult to capture skateboarding than it may seem. Also, good work on the lighting. 9.</td>', 'Even after reading more than a few skateboarding magazines myself, this definently beats some of their photography. I hope this is voted decently, because it is a lot more difficult to capture skateboarding than it may seem. Also, good work on the lighting. 9.', '2006-08-10 06:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713782, 375889, 55773, '<td valign="top">Personally I would''ve cloned out the bubbles from the milk, but it still works.</td>', 'Personally I would''ve cloned out the bubbles from the milk, but it still works.', '2006-08-10 06:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713812, 375913, 16004, '<td valign="top">this would be more striking if i hadn''t come across the other one that looks like it was taken in the same place first (i''m surprised he isn''t in the shot - must have been just in front of you!)...  the same criticism i had of that one applies here; the background is too messy and cluttered and detracts from the overall shot. a liberally application of the burn and blur tools might have reduced the impact of the background a bit.   i would certinaly have cropped of the left portion of the picture, say half to an inch away from the flying persons head.  i like the lad watching on the bike, gives something extra to the overall composition and life of the picture... 5.</td>', 'this would be more striking if i hadn''t come across the other one that looks like it was taken in the same place first (i''m surprised he isn''t in the shot - must have been just in front of you!)...  the same criticism i had of that one applies here; the background is too messy and cluttered and detracts from the overall shot. a liberally application of the burn and blur tools might have reduced the impact of the background a bit.   i would certinaly have cropped of the left portion of the picture, say half to an inch away from the flying persons head.  i like the lad watching on the bike, gives something extra to the overall composition and life of the picture... 5.', '2006-08-10 06:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713836, 375851, 48545, '<td valign="top">Good timing on the image, looks a little ''snapshotty'' though.  Maybe you''ve had to crop quite a lot to get to the action, as the photo is quite grainy as well.</td>', 'Good timing on the image, looks a little ''snapshotty'' though.  Maybe you''ve had to crop quite a lot to get to the action, as the photo is quite grainy as well.', '2006-08-10 07:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713842, 375087, 48545, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good focus on the water jet and the picture tells a nice story.  The water is lost a bit in the background at the top which is a shame but unavoidable.  Not sure I''m a fan of the beveled border.</td>', 'Nice image, good focus on the water jet and the picture tells a nice story.  The water is lost a bit in the background at the top which is a shame but unavoidable.  Not sure I''m a fan of the beveled border.', '2006-08-10 07:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713843, 375311, 48545, '<td valign="top">This is too far away to give the impression of stopped action with any impact.  Get closer to the subjects and the image should become much more powerful.</td>', 'This is too far away to give the impression of stopped action with any impact.  Get closer to the subjects and the image should become much more powerful.', '2006-08-10 07:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713851, 375249, 37334, '<td valign="top">Lucky you!</td>', 'Lucky you!', '2006-08-10 07:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713853, 375591, 37334, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture. The Body shape is wonderful!!</td>', 'Really nice capture. The Body shape is wonderful!!', '2006-08-10 07:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713854, 375610, 42495, '<td valign="top">Clever take on the water drop picture.  Well done.</td>', 'Clever take on the water drop picture.  Well done.', '2006-08-10 07:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713857, 375722, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  The reflections in the bulb make me wonder about how you did this (in a good way).</td>', 'Great capture!  The reflections in the bulb make me wonder about how you did this (in a good way).', '2006-08-10 07:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713858, 375773, 63789, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. And'' the fleeing instant that becomes eternal. The essence of the photo.</td>', 'Fantastic. And'' the fleeing instant that becomes eternal. The essence of the photo.', '2006-08-10 07:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2713859, 375803, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2006-08-10 07:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
