(2715089, 375610, 30049, '<td valign="top">For some reason, from the thumbnail view, I thought the sphere was a bullet point.  Now, as to how you did this...hmmm.  Double exposure?  Will be interested to see in your comments.  You did list comments didn''t you?  ;^)<br/> <br/>Very creative.  Nice stopped motion.  Should do well with this.  I''d say "Good luck", but I don''t think you need it.  He-he.</td>', 'For some reason, from the thumbnail view, I thought the sphere was a bullet point.  Now, as to how you did this...hmmm.  Double exposure?  Will be interested to see in your comments.  You did list comments didn''t you?  ;^) Very creative.  Nice stopped motion.  Should do well with this.  I''d say "Good luck", but I don''t think you need it.  He-he.', '2006-08-10 16:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715094, 375788, 55822, '<td valign="top">Great expressions on their faces. Good timing.</td>', 'Great expressions on their faces. Good timing.', '2006-08-10 16:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715098, 375912, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at.  I like the kicked up sand being "frozen"...that works for ''Stopped Motion''.  ;^)  On the down side, the image seems a little flat like it needs a shot of contrast, and maybe a small boost in color saturation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting to look at.  I like the kicked up sand being "frozen"...that works for ''Stopped Motion''.  ;^)  On the down side, the image seems a little flat like it needs a shot of contrast, and maybe a small boost in color saturation.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-10 16:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
