(2715145, 375722, 30049, '<td valign="top">Took a minute to figure this out.  I know, I didn''t look at the title.  Interesting the way the broken glass has moved. Fun to look at.  Must be nice to have the equipment to do this.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Took a minute to figure this out.  I know, I didn''t look at the title.  Interesting the way the broken glass has moved. Fun to look at.  Must be nice to have the equipment to do this.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-10 16:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
