(2715374, 375504, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Contrast is pretty high though (the bee loses a lot of detail in the shadows and the flowers are very slightly washed out). I''d love to see this if you could bring out some of the shadow detail and darken the BG slightly to make the flowers pop a bit more.</td>', 'Great capture. Contrast is pretty high though (the bee loses a lot of detail in the shadows and the flowers are very slightly washed out). I''d love to see this if you could bring out some of the shadow detail and darken the BG slightly to make the flowers pop a bit more.', '2006-08-10 18:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715386, 374700, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the colors in the BG and the subject. There is some pretty disturbing artifacting around the subject and the BG gradient is not too smooth. I suspect a Noise Ninja/Neat Image problem or oversharpening or resizing or a combination of the above is at fault.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the colors in the BG and the subject. There is some pretty disturbing artifacting around the subject and the BG gradient is not too smooth. I suspect a Noise Ninja/Neat Image problem or oversharpening or resizing or a combination of the above is at fault.', '2006-08-10 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
