(2715756, 374122, 33552, '<td valign="top">What a face!</td>', 'What a face!', '2006-08-10 20:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715783, 375906, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has some nice contrast to it.  The white on the seagull may be a little hot, but not bad.  I like this, having the boats in the background, adds some context to this image - many times all you see is the seagull and nothing else in many images.  Looking kind of hazy in the background - have you tried using a UV filter?  Would help with that.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has some nice contrast to it.  The white on the seagull may be a little hot, but not bad.  I like this, having the boats in the background, adds some context to this image - many times all you see is the seagull and nothing else in many images.  Looking kind of hazy in the background - have you tried using a UV filter?  Would help with that.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-10 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715790, 375546, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a very cute photo of a cat.  ;^)  Good color, clarity and composition overall.  Hard to tell on the stopped motion because this is such an unusual stance/action for a cat to take...does a cat on it''s back legs usually move very fast, or was this an easy image to get?  Do you know what I''m trying to say?  The top images for this challenge will probably have some action that is easily identifiable as being fast/quick.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a very cute photo of a cat.  ;^)  Good color, clarity and composition overall.  Hard to tell on the stopped motion because this is such an unusual stance/action for a cat to take...does a cat on it''s back legs usually move very fast, or was this an easy image to get?  Do you know what I''m trying to say?  The top images for this challenge will probably have some action that is easily identifiable as being fast/quick.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-10 20:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715796, 375787, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear.  The water almost makes this look like a ton of neat image was applied.  The water splash has certainly been stopped.  Good job overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very crisp and clear.  The water almost makes this look like a ton of neat image was applied.  The water splash has certainly been stopped.  Good job overall.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-10 20:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715799, 375875, 30049, '<td valign="top">Has an abstract feel to it.  Kind of cool.  The color tone works well to convey refreshing water.  Is this a shower head?  Good luck.  Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Has an abstract feel to it.  Kind of cool.  The color tone works well to convey refreshing water.  Is this a shower head?  Good luck.  Hope it does well for you.', '2006-08-10 20:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715803, 375773, 20102, '<td valign="top">super cool</td>', 'super cool', '2006-08-10 20:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715808, 375746, 20102, '<td valign="top">what a cutie!</td>', 'what a cutie!', '2006-08-10 20:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715814, 375809, 20102, '<td valign="top">i hope no fishies were harmed in the making of this awesome photograph.</td>', 'i hope no fishies were harmed in the making of this awesome photograph.', '2006-08-10 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715815, 375278, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a pain.  you spend all the time hunched over, chasing that damn bee, and you can''t get him to face you.  it''s a shame, because it really takes away from the shot, with him flying out of the frame.</td>', 'what a pain.  you spend all the time hunched over, chasing that damn bee, and you can''t get him to face you.  it''s a shame, because it really takes away from the shot, with him flying out of the frame.', '2006-08-10 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715820, 374122, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile - nicely caught action.</td>', 'This makes me smile - nicely caught action.', '2006-08-10 20:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715821, 375363, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a little too much blur (at least for us anal dmnc nazis).  it looks like it could stand to be a hair sharper.</td>', 'nice idea, but a little too much blur (at least for us anal dmnc nazis).  it looks like it could stand to be a hair sharper.', '2006-08-10 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715823, 375452, 30982, '<td valign="top">The dragonfly nearly disappears into the clouds.  Love the rocks.</td>', 'The dragonfly nearly disappears into the clouds.  Love the rocks.', '2006-08-10 20:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715828, 375757, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you''ve stopped something in motion, but the image falls short of making me feel like "wow, how''d they do that."</td>', 'yes, you''ve stopped something in motion, but the image falls short of making me feel like "wow, how''d they do that."', '2006-08-10 20:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715831, 375847, 23394, '<td valign="top">obviously, the bird''s in motion, but the image doesn''t strike me as one that was terribly difficult to capture.  aesthetically, it''s nice enough, but it doesn''t really move me.</td>', 'obviously, the bird''s in motion, but the image doesn''t strike me as one that was terribly difficult to capture.  aesthetically, it''s nice enough, but it doesn''t really move me.', '2006-08-10 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715838, 375859, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like when you cropped and rotated you may have missed a bit in the lower left corner.  Nice bokeh on this.</td>', 'Looks like when you cropped and rotated you may have missed a bit in the lower left corner.  Nice bokeh on this.', '2006-08-10 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715841, 374922, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, nothing here to indicate stopped motion.  aside from that, the technicals could use some work (it''s a little soft).  compositionally, it doesn''t really grab me--not enough there to catch and hold my interest.</td>', 'sorry, nothing here to indicate stopped motion.  aside from that, the technicals could use some work (it''s a little soft).  compositionally, it doesn''t really grab me--not enough there to catch and hold my interest.', '2006-08-10 20:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715844, 375788, 30982, '<td valign="top">The expressions are great!</td>', 'The expressions are great!', '2006-08-10 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715845, 375637, 30982, '<td valign="top">I guess the stopped motion is the flag, since I''m thinking the buildings aren''t going anywhere.  A bit plain for this challenge.</td>', 'I guess the stopped motion is the flag, since I''m thinking the buildings aren''t going anywhere.  A bit plain for this challenge.', '2006-08-10 20:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715847, 374959, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Colors are excellent, too.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Colors are excellent, too.', '2006-08-10 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715850, 375696, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe it was moving, maybe it''s a setup.  it''s an ok idea, but the execution needs work.  what if you had taken a photo of someone actually catching a flipped coin, focused in tightly on their hand about to grab the flipping coin out of mid-air?  also, the lighting really takes away from the image--need to experiment and practice with that.</td>', 'maybe it was moving, maybe it''s a setup.  it''s an ok idea, but the execution needs work.  what if you had taken a photo of someone actually catching a flipped coin, focused in tightly on their hand about to grab the flipping coin out of mid-air?  also, the lighting really takes away from the image--need to experiment and practice with that.', '2006-08-10 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715852, 375645, 30982, '<td valign="top">Placement of the sun with respect to the belly is a bit unfortunate.  Like the shot, though!</td>', 'Placement of the sun with respect to the belly is a bit unfortunate.  Like the shot, though!', '2006-08-10 20:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715856, 375324, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the use of vignetting on this one.  Also really like the shadow - which to me is the focal point of the picture.</td>', 'I like the use of vignetting on this one.  Also really like the shadow - which to me is the focal point of the picture.', '2006-08-10 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715858, 375836, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I''d level the tub edge a little.</td>', 'Very cute.  I''d level the tub edge a little.', '2006-08-10 20:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715863, 375814, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but i guess you were hoping no one would notice the ''motion blur''...  <br/> <br/>i know it''s tough to throw these images away, especially when something like this just jumps up right in front of you.  but, if you really want to get good, you need to do two things:  1) practice, practice, practice, practice, so that when you have opportunities like this, you can respond quickly and correctly, and 2) delete and move on when you don''t get it.  it''s ok to keep some of them just for the sake of keeping them, but if you care about your scores, don''t enter them into challenges without reading the descriptions carefully...</td>', 'nice idea, but i guess you were hoping no one would notice the ''motion blur''...   i know it''s tough to throw these images away, especially when something like this just jumps up right in front of you.  but, if you really want to get good, you need to do two things:  1) practice, practice, practice, practice, so that when you have opportunities like this, you can respond quickly and correctly, and 2) delete and move on when you don''t get it.  it''s ok to keep some of them just for the sake of keeping them, but if you care about your scores, don''t enter them into challenges without reading the descriptions carefully...', '2006-08-10 20:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715864, 375205, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a bit too much blur and not quite sharp enough.</td>', 'nice idea, but a bit too much blur and not quite sharp enough.', '2006-08-10 20:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715867, 375883, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but probably a bit too abstract for most people to appreciate in the context of a challenge...</td>', 'interesting idea, but probably a bit too abstract for most people to appreciate in the context of a challenge...', '2006-08-10 20:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715869, 375703, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, but a bit too much blur for a challenge asking for none.  don''t mean to be so anal, but hey, that''s what the descriptions are for.</td>', 'lovely shot, but a bit too much blur for a challenge asking for none.  don''t mean to be so anal, but hey, that''s what the descriptions are for.', '2006-08-10 20:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715870, 374085, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a little soft.</td>', 'nice idea, but a little soft.', '2006-08-10 20:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715876, 375278, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the "backside" view.  Very good color.</td>', 'I like the "backside" view.  Very good color.', '2006-08-10 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715877, 375882, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a bit boring.  maybe if you had cropped in tighter and tried some different rotations?  it also appears to have some jpg artifacting, as well (note: i''m giving this a place holder score of 3 just so i can find it when i look at it on another monitor.  once i do that, i''ll bump your score back up to where it was.  i just want to check out the image quality first.)</td>', 'nice idea, but a bit boring.  maybe if you had cropped in tighter and tried some different rotations?  it also appears to have some jpg artifacting, as well (note: i''m giving this a place holder score of 3 just so i can find it when i look at it on another monitor.  once i do that, i''ll bump your score back up to where it was.  i just want to check out the image quality first.)', '2006-08-10 21:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715881, 375902, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  A little touch of levels would really bring this out more.</td>', 'Nice composition.  A little touch of levels would really bring this out more.', '2006-08-10 21:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715885, 373870, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the color of the water.  His skin looks a little plastic to me, though.</td>', 'I like the pose and the color of the water.  His skin looks a little plastic to me, though.', '2006-08-10 21:05:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2715887, 375309, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the energy of this!</td>', 'I like the energy of this!', '2006-08-10 21:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715892, 375889, 23394, '<td valign="top">it''s one thing to do this just for yourself, but, if you''re doing it for a challenge, it had bettered be one of the best, most unique approaches to the cliche ever, if you want to score well...otherwise, your score will...plop ;-)</td>', 'it''s one thing to do this just for yourself, but, if you''re doing it for a challenge, it had bettered be one of the best, most unique approaches to the cliche ever, if you want to score well...otherwise, your score will...plop ;-)', '2006-08-10 21:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715896, 375452, 23394, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t really grab me.  the subject is more an annoyance than a subject, like something that got in the way.  it''s not detailed enough to really lend itself to the challenge.  love the rocks, though.</td>', 'it doesn''t really grab me.  the subject is more an annoyance than a subject, like something that got in the way.  it''s not detailed enough to really lend itself to the challenge.  love the rocks, though.', '2006-08-10 21:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715900, 375741, 23394, '<td valign="top">you got the easy part of the swing...the challenge would have been to have stopped the motion at the point of impact.  it''s a beautiful shot, but as far as the challenge goes, i think you missed a real opportunity.</td>', 'you got the easy part of the swing...the challenge would have been to have stopped the motion at the point of impact.  it''s a beautiful shot, but as far as the challenge goes, i think you missed a real opportunity.', '2006-08-10 21:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715903, 373501, 23394, '<td valign="top">it''s a shame about the angle that you caught this.  it''s hard to tell if it''s in flight, or resting.  pretty shot, though.</td>', 'it''s a shame about the angle that you caught this.  it''s hard to tell if it''s in flight, or resting.  pretty shot, though.', '2006-08-10 21:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715906, 375637, 23394, '<td valign="top">if you are going to get so far out of the box that people aren''t sure how you''re meeting the challenge, you really need to have an outstanding shot.  sorry, but this isn''t one of them.  it''s not that sharp, your horizon is off, and the composition doesn''t really offer much.<br/> <br/>if you want better scores, maybe check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'if you are going to get so far out of the box that people aren''t sure how you''re meeting the challenge, you really need to have an outstanding shot.  sorry, but this isn''t one of them.  it''s not that sharp, your horizon is off, and the composition doesn''t really offer much. if you want better scores, maybe check out this thread.', '2006-08-10 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2715911, 375906, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know why, but this shot just looks weird to me, almost like you pasted the gull in (but i know you didn''t).  maybe if it was a bit sharper, it would be easier for me to enjoy.</td>', 'i don''t know why, but this shot just looks weird to me, almost like you pasted the gull in (but i know you didn''t).  maybe if it was a bit sharper, it would be easier for me to enjoy.', '2006-08-10 21:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
