(2715957, 375686, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great choice of black and white - great shot, too.  Almost wish there was just a bit more room on the bottom.</td>', 'Great choice of black and white - great shot, too.  Almost wish there was just a bit more room on the bottom.', '2006-08-10 21:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
