(2716008, 375813, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The lighting is a bit too grey. I live in New England so I know what the sky and sea can change to without any notice. Good luck...</td>', 'Great capture. The lighting is a bit too grey. I live in New England so I know what the sky and sea can change to without any notice. Good luck...', '2006-08-10 22:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
