(2716156, 372964, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors on this and great stopped motion.<br/>The composition doesn''t work for me. I think it needs to have more <br/>emphasis put on the ball by cropping to portrait mode and leaving<br/>off the majority of the right side. Ideally, a different angle when shooting to eliminate the bits of tree on the top left and include more of the catcher''s mitt. Just my humble opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful colors on this and great stopped motion.The composition doesn''t work for me. I think it needs to have more emphasis put on the ball by cropping to portrait mode and leavingoff the majority of the right side. Ideally, a different angle when shooting to eliminate the bits of tree on the top left and include more of the catcher''s mitt. Just my humble opinion.', '2006-08-10 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
