(2716309, 372964, 35513, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are nicely done, and you''ve capture the motion without any blur.  However, there is some noticeable grain in the sky which is somewhat distracting to me.  And while I like the texture that the clouds and trees lend to the photo, I feel it might have more of an impact if the subject was a bit stronger.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are nicely done, and you''ve capture the motion without any blur.  However, there is some noticeable grain in the sky which is somewhat distracting to me.  And while I like the texture that the clouds and trees lend to the photo, I feel it might have more of an impact if the subject was a bit stronger.', '2006-08-10 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2716312, 374922, 35513, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a pretty good job with the composition here.  The eye is drawn strongly to your subject.  However, the dragonfly seems to be slightly out of focus, especially around the wings.</td>', 'You''ve done a pretty good job with the composition here.  The eye is drawn strongly to your subject.  However, the dragonfly seems to be slightly out of focus, especially around the wings.', '2006-08-11 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
