(2716344, 375363, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good natural colors in this shot.  The noise in the photo is somewhat distracting to me, but it looks like you''ve captured some good detail on these birds!</td>', 'Good natural colors in this shot.  The noise in the photo is somewhat distracting to me, but it looks like you''ve captured some good detail on these birds!', '2006-08-11 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
