(2716731, 375645, 31307, '<td valign="top">Pretty backdrop and nice framing.  However, the harsh flash detracts from this shot and the sun call attention to the guy''s waist and boxers/lanyard and distract from what you want the viewer to focus on.  I think the was a great idea and has very good potential.  I feel like it could have been a little better executed, though.</td>', 'Pretty backdrop and nice framing.  However, the harsh flash detracts from this shot and the sun call attention to the guy''s waist and boxers/lanyard and distract from what you want the viewer to focus on.  I think the was a great idea and has very good potential.  I feel like it could have been a little better executed, though.', '2006-08-11 04:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2716732, 375573, 31307, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  If I could make one change though, it would be to play with the contrast so as to make that sky REALLY pop.  The grass in the foreground is a little distracting, too, but the image overall is very impressive.</td>', 'Awesome.  If I could make one change though, it would be to play with the contrast so as to make that sky REALLY pop.  The grass in the foreground is a little distracting, too, but the image overall is very impressive.', '2006-08-11 04:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
