(2716959, 375359, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice effort, leaving an interesting composition.  the touch of red and the overall lighting make this look more like art and less like a technical/documentary/textbook shot.  good work.</td>', 'nice effort, leaving an interesting composition.  the touch of red and the overall lighting make this look more like art and less like a technical/documentary/textbook shot.  good work.', '2006-08-11 08:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
