(2716967, 375579, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but it is really subtle.  i think the foreground object doesn''t really add to the photo, and maybe if the pouring had been more on an angle.  all the same, i hope the violent mixture isn''t lost on the speed voters.</td>', 'nice idea, but it is really subtle.  i think the foreground object doesn''t really add to the photo, and maybe if the pouring had been more on an angle.  all the same, i hope the violent mixture isn''t lost on the speed voters.', '2006-08-11 08:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
