(2716984, 375863, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, definitely meets the challenge.  my only preference would have been to have had more of the dog in focus, as opposed to only the spray (this is why i shoot some specific sports shot in manual focus, so that the ai doesn''t end up hunting the wrong subject).</td>', 'excellent idea, definitely meets the challenge.  my only preference would have been to have had more of the dog in focus, as opposed to only the spray (this is why i shoot some specific sports shot in manual focus, so that the ai doesn''t end up hunting the wrong subject).', '2006-08-11 08:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2716988, 375892, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a needs a bit of work on the execution.  the background really kills the shot, and his arm position (blocking his face), doesn''t help either.  this type of shot could have been a front-page contender, if shot with a little more attention to those details.</td>', 'nice idea, but a needs a bit of work on the execution.  the background really kills the shot, and his arm position (blocking his face), doesn''t help either.  this type of shot could have been a front-page contender, if shot with a little more attention to those details.', '2006-08-11 08:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2716989, 375311, 23394, '<td valign="top">a beautiful, timeless shot, yes.  i think a square crop would have made this a better entry.  also, if it had been shot from just a bit higher perspective, the far players'' heads wouldn''t be lost in the background.</td>', 'a beautiful, timeless shot, yes.  i think a square crop would have made this a better entry.  also, if it had been shot from just a bit higher perspective, the far players'' heads wouldn''t be lost in the background.', '2006-08-11 08:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2716990, 375849, 23394, '<td valign="top">tough shot.  i see where you''re going, but don''t think you''re there, yet.  i think once you''re free of the dpc challenge constraints, you''ll be able to go back and shoot this the way you really want to capture it, a little sharper, a little more definition on the birds, a little less motion.  who knows, maybe it already has what you want, but because of size limitations, we just can''t see it...</td>', 'tough shot.  i see where you''re going, but don''t think you''re there, yet.  i think once you''re free of the dpc challenge constraints, you''ll be able to go back and shoot this the way you really want to capture it, a little sharper, a little more definition on the birds, a little less motion.  who knows, maybe it already has what you want, but because of size limitations, we just can''t see it...', '2006-08-11 08:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717000, 375788, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, great capture of their expressions.  too bad you didn''t have one from a half-second later, when they made their splash.  the framing is spot on.</td>', 'excellent idea, great capture of their expressions.  too bad you didn''t have one from a half-second later, when they made their splash.  the framing is spot on.', '2006-08-11 08:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717001, 375514, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely captured.  this will probably do well.  hope your winnings cover your expenses ;-)</td>', 'nicely captured.  this will probably do well.  hope your winnings cover your expenses ;-)', '2006-08-11 08:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717015, 375813, 23394, '<td valign="top">you got the right idea, but it needs some work.  the image is too muted, indicating that a bit more post-processing is in order.  with the sky so flat, a gradient map would have really helped.  it also looks as though it could be a bit sharper.  i like the vertical shot, but feel the subject is just a bit too centered.<br/> <br/>after the challenge, you might consider asking bear and/or others for some more concrete post-processing help and suggestions.</td>', 'you got the right idea, but it needs some work.  the image is too muted, indicating that a bit more post-processing is in order.  with the sky so flat, a gradient map would have really helped.  it also looks as though it could be a bit sharper.  i like the vertical shot, but feel the subject is just a bit too centered. after the challenge, you might consider asking bear and/or others for some more concrete post-processing help and suggestions.', '2006-08-11 08:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717019, 375860, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you''ve stopped some motion, but, what is the subject?  the stopped spray?  it''s difficult to tell with the given composition.  it''s not enough to technically meet the challenge, but you also need to consider the aesthetics as well.</td>', 'yes, you''ve stopped some motion, but, what is the subject?  the stopped spray?  it''s difficult to tell with the given composition.  it''s not enough to technically meet the challenge, but you also need to consider the aesthetics as well.', '2006-08-11 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717023, 375416, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a tough shot, especially the way those things fly.  even though you have caught this one in flight, the positioning doesn''t really do much for the composition.  this time of day leaves the colors so washed that you might have done well to consider a bw conversion.</td>', 'this is a tough shot, especially the way those things fly.  even though you have caught this one in flight, the positioning doesn''t really do much for the composition.  this time of day leaves the colors so washed that you might have done well to consider a bw conversion.', '2006-08-11 08:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717025, 375091, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get the idea, and like the colored background, but feel there is too much focus on the hammer and not enough of the glass to really get the idea across.</td>', 'i get the idea, and like the colored background, but feel there is too much focus on the hammer and not enough of the glass to really get the idea across.', '2006-08-11 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717035, 375686, 23394, '<td valign="top">please accept my apolgies for what i''m about to say...<br/> <br/>this image is spot on!<br/> <br/>wonderful image.  wish there had been a little more spray, but, all the same, perfectly exposed in a very tough lighting situation.  you owe it to yourself to get at least an 11x14 of this for your wall.</td>', 'please accept my apolgies for what i''m about to say... this image is spot on! wonderful image.  wish there had been a little more spray, but, all the same, perfectly exposed in a very tough lighting situation.  you owe it to yourself to get at least an 11x14 of this for your wall.', '2006-08-11 08:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717036, 375572, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  would have been better if you had shot tighter, so that we could see their expressions a little more clearly.  with that much spray, it''s obvious that you''ve stopped the motion; tighter in would really make the image scream off the screen. still good enough for a bump.</td>', 'nice idea.  would have been better if you had shot tighter, so that we could see their expressions a little more clearly.  with that much spray, it''s obvious that you''ve stopped the motion; tighter in would really make the image scream off the screen. still good enough for a bump.', '2006-08-11 08:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717041, 374308, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, but somehow the execution has been left in the dust.  the subjects aren''t sharp enough and the framing isn''t tight enough.  the overall image is muted enough to indicate that a bit more post-processing would have helped (since this is advanced editing, you need to take advantage of every tool available).</td>', 'great idea, but somehow the execution has been left in the dust.  the subjects aren''t sharp enough and the framing isn''t tight enough.  the overall image is muted enough to indicate that a bit more post-processing would have helped (since this is advanced editing, you need to take advantage of every tool available).', '2006-08-11 08:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717043, 375656, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a nice enough image, but not really a strong challenge entry.</td>', 'this is a nice enough image, but not really a strong challenge entry.', '2006-08-11 08:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717049, 374465, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome image, and killer processing...but, unfortunately, taken too far for this specific challenge. while i absolutely love this shot (just wish it wasn''t so tight on the right), i think the blur is going to hold it back score-wise.  hopefully, i''ll be wrong about this.</td>', 'awesome image, and killer processing...but, unfortunately, taken too far for this specific challenge. while i absolutely love this shot (just wish it wasn''t so tight on the right), i think the blur is going to hold it back score-wise.  hopefully, i''ll be wrong about this.', '2006-08-11 08:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717050, 375894, 23394, '<td valign="top">great idea, but something is missing to give it a real zing.  i know this is going to sound weird, but it doesn''t seem to be that fluid.  it''s as if the action has happened, but i can''t find any congruent lines to follow to help me reconcile what action is happening.</td>', 'great idea, but something is missing to give it a real zing.  i know this is going to sound weird, but it doesn''t seem to be that fluid.  it''s as if the action has happened, but i can''t find any congruent lines to follow to help me reconcile what action is happening.', '2006-08-11 08:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717051, 375619, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but doesn''t really convey a sense of stopped motion.  more like sleeping in a ball.  if you drew an outline of a duffle bag around him, you could call it ''how to pack a stowaway''.</td>', 'nice idea, but doesn''t really convey a sense of stopped motion.  more like sleeping in a ball.  if you drew an outline of a duffle bag around him, you could call it ''how to pack a stowaway''.', '2006-08-11 08:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717052, 375759, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the image, but feel it is a bit too abstract for me to be able too readily relate it to the challenge.  this is really one of those damned-if-you-do-damned-if-you-don''t type shots...</td>', 'i like the image, but feel it is a bit too abstract for me to be able too readily relate it to the challenge.  this is really one of those damned-if-you-do-damned-if-you-don''t type shots...', '2006-08-11 08:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717055, 373912, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you pretty much stopped the motion of the water, but as it''s pretty much just a centered snapshot of a fountain, there''s not a lot here to keep my interest.</td>', 'yes, you pretty much stopped the motion of the water, but as it''s pretty much just a centered snapshot of a fountain, there''s not a lot here to keep my interest.', '2006-08-11 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
