(2717059, 375746, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you have a whole week to spend with this challenge, in addition to TWO previous stop motion challenges that are chockful of examples as to what works and what doesn''t.  you obviously have a decent camera.  and yet, you enter a cat yawning...if you want better scores, maybe check out this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">thread</a>.</td>', 'ok, you have a whole week to spend with this challenge, in addition to TWO previous stop motion challenges that are chockful of examples as to what works and what doesn''t.  you obviously have a decent camera.  and yet, you enter a cat yawning...if you want better scores, maybe check out this thread.', '2006-08-11 08:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717063, 375788, 40077, '<td valign="top">i love this shot, facial expressions are brilliant and hopefully you will do really well. good job!</td>', 'i love this shot, facial expressions are brilliant and hopefully you will do really well. good job!', '2006-08-11 08:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717067, 375463, 40077, '<td valign="top">good shot, nice one. i think the flying cap adds a lot to this shot, i cant pin-point exactly why but for me it works, well done.</td>', 'good shot, nice one. i think the flying cap adds a lot to this shot, i cant pin-point exactly why but for me it works, well done.', '2006-08-11 08:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717071, 375784, 40077, '<td valign="top">ah good and clever title, the shot is good too having the main subject off centre works well here. good luck.</td>', 'ah good and clever title, the shot is good too having the main subject off centre works well here. good luck.', '2006-08-11 08:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717072, 375278, 40077, '<td valign="top">really really nice and clear shot.</td>', 'really really nice and clear shot.', '2006-08-11 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717090, 375710, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a creative and interesting concept.  It appears you''ve stopped the motion of most water droplets and some pasta, however there are some motion trails and/or blurriness of the pasta inside the strainer.  Not trying to be nit picky, just pointing out what the viewer/voter might see but NOT tell you.  ;^)  The exposure is good.  Not sure about the additional items in the vicinity...thinking they may hurt more than help as they do draw the eye away from the main subject.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a creative and interesting concept.  It appears you''ve stopped the motion of most water droplets and some pasta, however there are some motion trails and/or blurriness of the pasta inside the strainer.  Not trying to be nit picky, just pointing out what the viewer/voter might see but NOT tell you.  ;^)  The exposure is good.  Not sure about the additional items in the vicinity...thinking they may hurt more than help as they do draw the eye away from the main subject.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 09:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717099, 375771, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Interesting.  Non-conformist with the blurred people around the main subject.  ;^)  May come back to bite you with the voters.  It''s a cool effect and gives additional interest to this image...only time will tell.  I like the desat, very clever in this situation.  Your subject may be a bit small to get maximum impact from the voters (in comparison to all the motion around the subject).  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Interesting.  Non-conformist with the blurred people around the main subject.  ;^)  May come back to bite you with the voters.  It''s a cool effect and gives additional interest to this image...only time will tell.  I like the desat, very clever in this situation.  Your subject may be a bit small to get maximum impact from the voters (in comparison to all the motion around the subject).  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 09:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717104, 374465, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the post-processing with the B/W and the glow effect.  It feels a bit underexposed on lighting.  You''ve done a good job stopping the motion catching her mid-stride and the hair blowing back.  Her shadow adds interest (you picked a good time of day for dramatic lighting).  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'I like the post-processing with the B/W and the glow effect.  It feels a bit underexposed on lighting.  You''ve done a good job stopping the motion catching her mid-stride and the hair blowing back.  Her shadow adds interest (you picked a good time of day for dramatic lighting).  Best of luck to you.', '2006-08-11 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717109, 375542, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sharp image.  Motion certainly stopped.  The smoke trails lend to leading lines of a sort, and the formation pattern is good.  Fun to look at image, should do ok for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Sharp image.  Motion certainly stopped.  The smoke trails lend to leading lines of a sort, and the formation pattern is good.  Fun to look at image, should do ok for you.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 09:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717113, 375580, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very good. excellent composition and exposure.</td>', 'Very good. excellent composition and exposure.', '2006-08-11 09:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717115, 375359, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Was that really a glass?  Pretty cool shatter if it was.  Should get some wow points for this.  It''s different than many similar images in this challenge with exploding this or that...  Will be interested in the photograhers comments on this one after the challenge is over.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow.  Was that really a glass?  Pretty cool shatter if it was.  Should get some wow points for this.  It''s different than many similar images in this challenge with exploding this or that...  Will be interested in the photograhers comments on this one after the challenge is over.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 09:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717124, 375594, 30049, '<td valign="top">What game are they playing?  The ball looks like a volleyball, but the players are in the same court area.  You''ve certainly captured ''Stopped Motion'' here.  Not seeing any motion trails/blur anywhere.  I do find the gal in the back left distracting as she''s drawing my attention out of the main subject area (I like her pose and obvious involvement in the action).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What game are they playing?  The ball looks like a volleyball, but the players are in the same court area.  You''ve certainly captured ''Stopped Motion'' here.  Not seeing any motion trails/blur anywhere.  I do find the gal in the back left distracting as she''s drawing my attention out of the main subject area (I like her pose and obvious involvement in the action).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 09:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717142, 374344, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well this is certainly a unique egg shot.  ;^)  Don''t think I''ve ever seen one quite like this.  Good image for doing the selective desat...works well here.  Have stopped all motion quite effectively.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well this is certainly a unique egg shot.  ;^)  Don''t think I''ve ever seen one quite like this.  Good image for doing the selective desat...works well here.  Have stopped all motion quite effectively.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 09:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717145, 375660, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is ok.  I know the planes are moving and you''ve stopped the motion per the challenge, but something just seems kind of static about this.  Nothing personal...it''s a good capture overall.  I would like to see a little more space at the bottom but it''s not critical.  Other than that it''s sharp and well exposed.  Hope it does well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is ok.  I know the planes are moving and you''ve stopped the motion per the challenge, but something just seems kind of static about this.  Nothing personal...it''s a good capture overall.  I would like to see a little more space at the bottom but it''s not critical.  Other than that it''s sharp and well exposed.  Hope it does well for you.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 09:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717151, 375898, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I''ve seen enough of these to know I need to get the equipment to try it - I think.  ;^)  Nothing personal, this shot is quite an accomplishment I''m sure, but some others I''ve seen like it are a little sharper and set up differently in lighting to make it more dramatic.  The bullet and spray on the left seem slightly blurred and noisy/grainy.</td>', 'Ok.  I''ve seen enough of these to know I need to get the equipment to try it - I think.  ;^)  Nothing personal, this shot is quite an accomplishment I''m sure, but some others I''ve seen like it are a little sharper and set up differently in lighting to make it more dramatic.  The bullet and spray on the left seem slightly blurred and noisy/grainy.', '2006-08-11 09:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717180, 375891, 30049, '<td valign="top">That duck has some nice color.  Speaking of color, something seems off in the color tones in this image.  Also appear to be a little underexposed as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'That duck has some nice color.  Speaking of color, something seems off in the color tones in this image.  Also appear to be a little underexposed as well.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717187, 375420, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow, a whole lot of splashing going on here!  ;^)   Looks like an exciting outing.  I wish the manaray was more identifiable.  You''ve stopped most of the motion  - not quite fast enough on the shutter speed as I see some motion blur, but overall very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow, a whole lot of splashing going on here!  ;^)   Looks like an exciting outing.  I wish the manaray was more identifiable.  You''ve stopped most of the motion  - not quite fast enough on the shutter speed as I see some motion blur, but overall very good.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717193, 375741, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve stopped the motion ok.  This shot has some additional impact potential had you gotten lower to the ground, maybe include some foreground grass up close.  Lighting is a little harsh.  If you dropped the highlights a little, and brought up the midtones it might help (in Post-Processing).  A polarizer would have helped this image and colors pop tremendously.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve stopped the motion ok.  This shot has some additional impact potential had you gotten lower to the ground, maybe include some foreground grass up close.  Lighting is a little harsh.  If you dropped the highlights a little, and brought up the midtones it might help (in Post-Processing).  A polarizer would have helped this image and colors pop tremendously.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717197, 374422, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh no!  It''s going to crash, the rotors have stopped turning!!!  Wait.  That''s just your shutter speed.  He-he.  Nice job of stopping the motion.  You''ve managed to take an image of an aircraft WITHOUT centering it in your composition.  Hooray!  Good to see that.  Even the top of the tree helps here as it adds context to the image.  Others will find that tree top distracting I imagine, but hey, this IS DPChallenge.  ;^)  Color in the sky seems off, but it may be the time of day?  Good luck.</td>', 'Oh no!  It''s going to crash, the rotors have stopped turning!!!  Wait.  That''s just your shutter speed.  He-he.  Nice job of stopping the motion.  You''ve managed to take an image of an aircraft WITHOUT centering it in your composition.  Hooray!  Good to see that.  Even the top of the tree helps here as it adds context to the image.  Others will find that tree top distracting I imagine, but hey, this IS DPChallenge.  ;^)  Color in the sky seems off, but it may be the time of day?  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717202, 375311, 30049, '<td valign="top">What game is it?  The goals are rather small, but that looks like a soccer ball.  Something about the lighting in this seems odd.  The faces are quite dark and the grass looks yellowish (same for the buildings in the top background).  You have done a nice job stopping the motion per the challenge theme.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What game is it?  The goals are rather small, but that looks like a soccer ball.  Something about the lighting in this seems odd.  The faces are quite dark and the grass looks yellowish (same for the buildings in the top background).  You have done a nice job stopping the motion per the challenge theme.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717207, 374295, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kudos to you if this motion was really stopped here.  It appears that the bulb has been placed on a mirror.  Unusual to see a bulb dropped and not have some pieces flying out a little.  Hmmm.  Will be interested to see how you did this after the challenge.  Did you shift the color hue some to get the bulb greenish blue like that?</td>', 'Kudos to you if this motion was really stopped here.  It appears that the bulb has been placed on a mirror.  Unusual to see a bulb dropped and not have some pieces flying out a little.  Hmmm.  Will be interested to see how you did this after the challenge.  Did you shift the color hue some to get the bulb greenish blue like that?', '2006-08-11 10:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717208, 375504, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a challenging shot to get and have it meet the Stopped Motion theme of the challenge.  The wings appear to have been stopped, but they are a little blurry, which could be simply from DOF and your aperture setting rather than too slow a shutter speed.  The bee does look not quite sharp overall, where the flower is...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a challenging shot to get and have it meet the Stopped Motion theme of the challenge.  The wings appear to have been stopped, but they are a little blurry, which could be simply from DOF and your aperture setting rather than too slow a shutter speed.  The bee does look not quite sharp overall, where the flower is...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717212, 375577, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice moment in a tough lighting situation.  a bit too much sharpening, though.</td>', 'nice moment in a tough lighting situation.  a bit too much sharpening, though.', '2006-08-11 10:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717235, 375411, 23394, '<td valign="top">too small, too dark.  my guess is that is one of your first entries, so please, don''t be discouraged if it doesn''t do as well as you would like.  you might want to read through <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread</a>, as well as check out the tutorial for <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">preparing your submissions</a>.</td>', 'too small, too dark.  my guess is that is one of your first entries, so please, don''t be discouraged if it doesn''t do as well as you would like.  you might want to read through this thread, as well as check out the tutorial for preparing your submissions.', '2006-08-11 10:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717239, 372964, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but it needs work to really get its point across.  the glove is too dark and the ball is far enough away that it takes more than a moment to ''get it''.  unfortunately, if you don''t hit viewers/voters right between the eyes, your score suffers...</td>', 'nice idea, but it needs work to really get its point across.  the glove is too dark and the ball is far enough away that it takes more than a moment to ''get it''.  unfortunately, if you don''t hit viewers/voters right between the eyes, your score suffers...', '2006-08-11 10:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717241, 375791, 30049, '<td valign="top">This one is fun.  Creative idea and mostly well executed.  The expression on her face works, composition is fine with the popcorn coming across the top third of the image.  Couple of minor nits; 1) The lighting on the popcorn and the bowl is a little strong (not sure how you could have reduced it and kept details on her - sorry) and 2) Don''t take this personally, but her skin around the eyes and on the forehead is a little oily and this has caused some distracting glare.  Hope this does ok for you because it IS a fun image.  Good luck.</td>', 'This one is fun.  Creative idea and mostly well executed.  The expression on her face works, composition is fine with the popcorn coming across the top third of the image.  Couple of minor nits; 1) The lighting on the popcorn and the bowl is a little strong (not sure how you could have reduced it and kept details on her - sorry) and 2) Don''t take this personally, but her skin around the eyes and on the forehead is a little oily and this has caused some distracting glare.  Hope this does ok for you because it IS a fun image.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 10:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717247, 374947, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, the dog''s in motion, but there''s not much here to really make the image work.  it may be that your camera is not best suited for this type of shot (the image could be a lot sharper).  as for adding interest, maybe if you had shot it from the ground up, you would have lost the distracting background.</td>', 'ok, the dog''s in motion, but there''s not much here to really make the image work.  it may be that your camera is not best suited for this type of shot (the image could be a lot sharper).  as for adding interest, maybe if you had shot it from the ground up, you would have lost the distracting background.', '2006-08-11 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717251, 374738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Now that is detailed, you can dang near count the rivets!  Question, how do I know this is moving?  Just being a bit cynical (sp?), but seriously, it''s hard for the viewer to get a sense of context here and the challenge calls for ''Stopped Motion''.  If you''ve really captured this, this sharply, and this plane IS moving - then WOW!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  Now that is detailed, you can dang near count the rivets!  Question, how do I know this is moving?  Just being a bit cynical (sp?), but seriously, it''s hard for the viewer to get a sense of context here and the challenge calls for ''Stopped Motion''.  If you''ve really captured this, this sharply, and this plane IS moving - then WOW!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717252, 374709, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the black background totally robs the image of any hint of motion.  maybe if you had thrown them up in the air, with some puffy clouds in the background...</td>', 'nice idea, but the black background totally robs the image of any hint of motion.  maybe if you had thrown them up in the air, with some puffy clouds in the background...', '2006-08-11 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2717254, 375041, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, but probably not the best challenge to have entered it in.  the motion that you''ve stopped just isn''t that dramatic.</td>', 'beautiful image, but probably not the best challenge to have entered it in.  the motion that you''ve stopped just isn''t that dramatic.', '2006-08-11 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717259, 374713, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good title!  ;^)  The dust at the feet makes this image work (along with the feet off the ground).  B/W was a good choice to eliminate background distractions.  Slight blur or fuzziness in the body area, and his shirt is a little hot (overexposed), are a couple of observations that could impact your score with viewers on the down side.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good title!  ;^)  The dust at the feet makes this image work (along with the feet off the ground).  B/W was a good choice to eliminate background distractions.  Slight blur or fuzziness in the body area, and his shirt is a little hot (overexposed), are a couple of observations that could impact your score with viewers on the down side.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717260, 375891, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is nice enough, but i imagine it would be scoring higher if the motion you''ve stopped was a bit more dramatic.  this is not much different than catching someone mid-stretch, except it is a lot more pleasant to look at.</td>', 'this is nice enough, but i imagine it would be scoring higher if the motion you''ve stopped was a bit more dramatic.  this is not much different than catching someone mid-stretch, except it is a lot more pleasant to look at.', '2006-08-11 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717264, 374973, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool jump!  He''s getting up there.  You''ve caught the action at the pivotal moment is seems.  Water is nicely frozen - maybe a little hot but not bad.  The jetski is well focused and I''m not sure how you could have composed this any differently for better impact.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool jump!  He''s getting up there.  You''ve caught the action at the pivotal moment is seems.  Water is nicely frozen - maybe a little hot but not bad.  The jetski is well focused and I''m not sure how you could have composed this any differently for better impact.  Should do ok with this.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 10:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717265, 375551, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but it could stand to be a bit sharper.  it would also help if the background wasn''t quite so busy--that takes a lot of the initial focus away.  another thing that would have helped would have been to have tried a number of different straws of different colors, then selected from the most dramatic (somehow, i think a hot red straw would have had more impact than this light yellow one.).</td>', 'nice idea, but it could stand to be a bit sharper.  it would also help if the background wasn''t quite so busy--that takes a lot of the initial focus away.  another thing that would have helped would have been to have tried a number of different straws of different colors, then selected from the most dramatic (somehow, i think a hot red straw would have had more impact than this light yellow one.).', '2006-08-11 10:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717273, 374776, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but unfortunately, it seems so set up that it takes away from the impression of actually ''stopping motion''.  it also looks like the knife is going to wind up a bit off target ;-)</td>', 'interesting idea, but unfortunately, it seems so set up that it takes away from the impression of actually ''stopping motion''.  it also looks like the knife is going to wind up a bit off target ;-)', '2006-08-11 10:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717275, 374922, 30049, '<td valign="top">I know this dragonfly COULD be moving, but it doesn''t look like it is, especially with it''s legs on the branch.  :(  Considering that the challenge theme is ''Stopped Motion'' you are probably going to take some flack on this one.  JMO of course.  The dragonfly itself could be better focused, it seems soft.  The end of the leftmost stick looks blownout, yet the dragonfly seems slightly underexposed...not sure how that happened?  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I know this dragonfly COULD be moving, but it doesn''t look like it is, especially with it''s legs on the branch.  :(  Considering that the challenge theme is ''Stopped Motion'' you are probably going to take some flack on this one.  JMO of course.  The dragonfly itself could be better focused, it seems soft.  The end of the leftmost stick looks blownout, yet the dragonfly seems slightly underexposed...not sure how that happened?  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717279, 375546, 23394, '<td valign="top">if your score isn''t where you want it to be, you might want to read through <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=156130#1084676" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread</a>.</td>', 'if your score isn''t where you want it to be, you might want to read through this thread.', '2006-08-11 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717283, 375249, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s fun getting so many hummingbirds at one time!  ;^)  Actually, in this case it helps having that third one even though the back one is a bit out of range for the aperture selected.  I say it helps because odd numbers seem to balance an image better than even.  Really don''t have much to say in ways of trying to improve this.  The two birds even with the feeder are nice and sharp, and most importantly (for this challenge) you''ve stopped the motion quite well.  Good luck.</td>', 'That''s fun getting so many hummingbirds at one time!  ;^)  Actually, in this case it helps having that third one even though the back one is a bit out of range for the aperture selected.  I say it helps because odd numbers seem to balance an image better than even.  Really don''t have much to say in ways of trying to improve this.  The two birds even with the feeder are nice and sharp, and most importantly (for this challenge) you''ve stopped the motion quite well.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 10:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717291, 375648, 23394, '<td valign="top">very interesting take on the challenge, that you would capture a subject that has stopped itself, rather than using the camera to stop a moving subject.  i like the image, and admire your initiative; it will be interesting to see how you are rewarded.  it''s just a shame your subject is looking out of the frame...</td>', 'very interesting take on the challenge, that you would capture a subject that has stopped itself, rather than using the camera to stop a moving subject.  i like the image, and admire your initiative; it will be interesting to see how you are rewarded.  it''s just a shame your subject is looking out of the frame...', '2006-08-11 10:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717298, 375754, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but really needs work.  it''s way too soft and way too muted.  not really sure what to make of the coloration, except to say it doesn''t really grab me.</td>', 'nice idea, but really needs work.  it''s way too soft and way too muted.  not really sure what to make of the coloration, except to say it doesn''t really grab me.', '2006-08-11 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717300, 375897, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good title, cute picture.  Is the bird singing or giving you a lecture?  ;^) Not sure if it''s the bird or the focus making it seem a little fuzzy/blurry.  Focus is sharp directly underneath the bird on the larger leaf. Hmmm.  You do have some noise/grain that could hurt your score a notch or two. Did you crop this down, or use too high an ISO?  Nonetheless, it''s a fun image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good title, cute picture.  Is the bird singing or giving you a lecture?  ;^) Not sure if it''s the bird or the focus making it seem a little fuzzy/blurry.  Focus is sharp directly underneath the bird on the larger leaf. Hmmm.  You do have some noise/grain that could hurt your score a notch or two. Did you crop this down, or use too high an ISO?  Nonetheless, it''s a fun image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717306, 374229, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an excellent idea.  if this didn''t have the background that it does, it would be a front-pager, undoubtedly.  if you don''t believe me, go back and remove the buildings and the car, and put in blue, puffy-clouded sky.  everything else is just perfect.  killer shoes.</td>', 'what an excellent idea.  if this didn''t have the background that it does, it would be a front-pager, undoubtedly.  if you don''t believe me, go back and remove the buildings and the car, and put in blue, puffy-clouded sky.  everything else is just perfect.  killer shoes.', '2006-08-11 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717309, 374738, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but no context to give even the illusion of ''stopping motion''.  for all i know, you walked under it while it was parked on the tarmac.</td>', 'beautiful shot, but no context to give even the illusion of ''stopping motion''.  for all i know, you walked under it while it was parked on the tarmac.', '2006-08-11 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717310, 375827, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2006-08-11 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717316, 374205, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like everyone is having fun.  Nice potential here.  You have a nice composition with the raft coming into the frame and some good action going on.  The motion has been stopped for the most part.  On the downside, the lighting is very harsh and the image is overexposed.  Looks like midday sun, so that is hard to get, especially with limited time for adjustments.  Would have been better to slightly underexpose perhaps in this case and try to bring it back in post-processing.   Once you''ve lost detail you can''t recover it.  Nice capture overall, just that darn lighting...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like everyone is having fun.  Nice potential here.  You have a nice composition with the raft coming into the frame and some good action going on.  The motion has been stopped for the most part.  On the downside, the lighting is very harsh and the image is overexposed.  Looks like midday sun, so that is hard to get, especially with limited time for adjustments.  Would have been better to slightly underexpose perhaps in this case and try to bring it back in post-processing.   Once you''ve lost detail you can''t recover it.  Nice capture overall, just that darn lighting...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717317, 375771, 8367, '<td valign="top">Perfect choice on the selective desat.</td>', 'Perfect choice on the selective desat.', '2006-08-11 10:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717318, 375647, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but needs work.  the horizon is tilted without adding anything to the image.  it could be a lot sharrper.  and, the coloration is just on the edge where you should have gone just a bit further, taking it more to that 60s look, or where you should have pulled back to what is a little more realistic.</td>', 'nice idea, but needs work.  the horizon is tilted without adding anything to the image.  it could be a lot sharrper.  and, the coloration is just on the edge where you should have gone just a bit further, taking it more to that 60s look, or where you should have pulled back to what is a little more realistic.', '2006-08-11 10:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717320, 375620, 23394, '<td valign="top">cool shot, just wish you had framed it a bit tighter.  all that foreground doesn''t really do anything.  also looks like it could have been just a bit sharper.</td>', 'cool shot, just wish you had framed it a bit tighter.  all that foreground doesn''t really do anything.  also looks like it could have been just a bit sharper.', '2006-08-11 10:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717324, 375673, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you''ve stopped motion, but it''s not really that dramatic.  this comes off looking more like a documentary snapshot for a county driver''s ed website.  from a different perspective, without such a busy/distracting background, you might could have gotten something much more dramatic.</td>', 'yes, you''ve stopped motion, but it''s not really that dramatic.  this comes off looking more like a documentary snapshot for a county driver''s ed website.  from a different perspective, without such a busy/distracting background, you might could have gotten something much more dramatic.', '2006-08-11 10:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717325, 375897, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is nice enough, but doesn''t really strike me as spectacular.  some subjects are just hard to shoot in such a way as make them really wow ya.</td>', 'this is nice enough, but doesn''t really strike me as spectacular.  some subjects are just hard to shoot in such a way as make them really wow ya.', '2006-08-11 10:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717326, 375749, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but not really frozen enough or interesting enough.</td>', 'nice idea, but not really frozen enough or interesting enough.', '2006-08-11 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717327, 375645, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the position of the sun really takes away from the image.  some images, like a nice landscape or sunset, do not always need a strong subject.  however, most images DO need a strong subject, where the essence of the image is conveyed instantly.  here, your subject is competing with it''s background.  it''s a nice idea, just poorly executed.  i imagine this would make a fantastic photo, if you had been between the man and the sun, with the man''s back to you.  then, without using the flash, you would have had the sunlight in the boy''s joyous face--and that would have been good for at least another point or two...</td>', 'nice idea, but the position of the sun really takes away from the image.  some images, like a nice landscape or sunset, do not always need a strong subject.  however, most images DO need a strong subject, where the essence of the image is conveyed instantly.  here, your subject is competing with it''s background.  it''s a nice idea, just poorly executed.  i imagine this would make a fantastic photo, if you had been between the man and the sun, with the man''s back to you.  then, without using the flash, you would have had the sunlight in the boy''s joyous face--and that would have been good for at least another point or two...', '2006-08-11 10:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717330, 375826, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice, solid piece of work.  might have been better to have been able to see more of his face.</td>', 'nice, solid piece of work.  might have been better to have been able to see more of his face.', '2006-08-11 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717332, 375416, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to catch.  The butterfly having it''s wings nearly closed makes it almost impossible to retain detail unless you have a very deep aperture.  But then you''d have to have a very high shutter speed to stop the motion.  What to do...what to do.  ;^)  I also wonder if instead of a square crop (I''m assuming, maybe incorrectly, that this was in landscape orientation originally), if you had taken just a bit more off the left and right to give it more of a portrait orientation, what that would have looked like.  Just a thought.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a tough one to catch.  The butterfly having it''s wings nearly closed makes it almost impossible to retain detail unless you have a very deep aperture.  But then you''d have to have a very high shutter speed to stop the motion.  What to do...what to do.  ;^)  I also wonder if instead of a square crop (I''m assuming, maybe incorrectly, that this was in landscape orientation originally), if you had taken just a bit more off the left and right to give it more of a portrait orientation, what that would have looked like.  Just a thought.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 10:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717334, 375832, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work.  could be a bit sharper, but, all the same, cool capture.  love the coolors and the composition.</td>', 'nice work.  could be a bit sharper, but, all the same, cool capture.  love the coolors and the composition.', '2006-08-11 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717337, 375260, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but that looks more like ginger ale than beer.  nice shot, though.</td>', 'sorry, but that looks more like ginger ale than beer.  nice shot, though.', '2006-08-11 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717338, 375417, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  don''t like the border, though.</td>', 'nice shot.  don''t like the border, though.', '2006-08-11 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717341, 375229, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow, that front wing is moving so fast it''s almost translucent.  This is a nice capture overall.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  Could be a bit sharper as the two main subject items seem a little soft.  The DOF works well to take out the background.  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow, that front wing is moving so fast it''s almost translucent.  This is a nice capture overall.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  Could be a bit sharper as the two main subject items seem a little soft.  The DOF works well to take out the background.  Hope this does well for you.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717343, 375916, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent opportunity, but not quite there.  the horizon is tilted without adding anything to the image.  it''s a bit dark (maybe try the shadow/highlights filter), and it is relatively soft.  you might have gotten better dpc results had you focused in tightly on one or two of the horses as they came by you.</td>', 'excellent opportunity, but not quite there.  the horizon is tilted without adding anything to the image.  it''s a bit dark (maybe try the shadow/highlights filter), and it is relatively soft.  you might have gotten better dpc results had you focused in tightly on one or two of the horses as they came by you.', '2006-08-11 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717344, 375678, 23394, '<td valign="top">love the idea, the colors, and the composition.  hope you''re not getting killed by the ''motion blur''.</td>', 'love the idea, the colors, and the composition.  hope you''re not getting killed by the ''motion blur''.', '2006-08-11 11:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717347, 374870, 23394, '<td valign="top">funny and strange.  hope this didn''t take too many tries.</td>', 'funny and strange.  hope this didn''t take too many tries.', '2006-08-11 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717348, 375784, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, probably would have had more impact if shot from the ground, where you could really see her feet off the ground.  it also is a bit soft.  nice composition, though.</td>', 'nice idea, probably would have had more impact if shot from the ground, where you could really see her feet off the ground.  it also is a bit soft.  nice composition, though.', '2006-08-11 11:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717349, 375414, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wet!  That''s the first thought that comes to mind.  ;^)   What is it, a firehose or something next to the person on the left?  The background looks like a huge wave hitting a retainer wall or something.  Very interesting to try and figure this out.  Then the water up close almost looks like it''s ready to hit the camera.  Hmmm.  Will be interested to see the details on this one after the challenge.  I think this is going to be a love it or hate it kind of shot with the voters.  Hopefully, people will slow down enough to look at it.  ;^)  Good luck!</td>', 'Wet!  That''s the first thought that comes to mind.  ;^)   What is it, a firehose or something next to the person on the left?  The background looks like a huge wave hitting a retainer wall or something.  Very interesting to try and figure this out.  Then the water up close almost looks like it''s ready to hit the camera.  Hmmm.  Will be interested to see the details on this one after the challenge.  I think this is going to be a love it or hate it kind of shot with the voters.  Hopefully, people will slow down enough to look at it.  ;^)  Good luck!', '2006-08-11 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
