(2717361, 375612, 23394, '<td valign="top">the problem here is that the image just isn''t sharp enough for most viewers/voters to quickly see that the fly hasn''t landed yet.  this is an EXTREMELY difficult shot, especially with so many variables outside your control.</td>', 'the problem here is that the image just isn''t sharp enough for most viewers/voters to quickly see that the fly hasn''t landed yet.  this is an EXTREMELY difficult shot, especially with so many variables outside your control.', '2006-08-11 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
