(2717365, 373523, 23394, '<td valign="top">i get the idea, but am not sure i like the result.  maybe it''s that the blue is too dark.  still, a pretty different take on the cliche.  good luck!</td>', 'i get the idea, but am not sure i like the result.  maybe it''s that the blue is too dark.  still, a pretty different take on the cliche.  good luck!', '2006-08-11 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
