(2717370, 375589, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting.  not sure if the cube going out of the frame helps or hurts the image.  if the score is higher than you expected, then it helped.  if it is lower than what you wanted, it hurt ;-)</td>', 'interesting.  not sure if the cube going out of the frame helps or hurts the image.  if the score is higher than you expected, then it helped.  if it is lower than what you wanted, it hurt ;-)', '2006-08-11 11:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
