(2717383, 374085, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image.  Motion is stopped just fine.  Looks a bit like a documentary type shot.  Something you would see in a textbook or website that provided details on the plane.  With that being said, I''m not sure how much "Wow" factor you''re going to get with the voters.  Yes, it''s a nice shot, but (nothing personal) not very exciting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice crisp image.  Motion is stopped just fine.  Looks a bit like a documentary type shot.  Something you would see in a textbook or website that provided details on the plane.  With that being said, I''m not sure how much "Wow" factor you''re going to get with the voters.  Yes, it''s a nice shot, but (nothing personal) not very exciting.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717388, 374169, 23394, '<td valign="top">close, but the background detracts and the cropped arm doesn''t help.  this might have been stronger as a bw.</td>', 'close, but the background detracts and the cropped arm doesn''t help.  this might have been stronger as a bw.', '2006-08-11 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717390, 375832, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  This is fun.  Nice job of stopping the motion overall.  Somehow this image feels like it''s been heavily processed as to noise.  Yes/No?  The skateboard is quite sharp and well focused on the nose but as you move back into the image the boarder is a little soft.  Could be the background overall, but there seems to be a blue cast to this also.  Did you try adjusting the color temp a little to experiment?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey.  This is fun.  Nice job of stopping the motion overall.  Somehow this image feels like it''s been heavily processed as to noise.  Yes/No?  The skateboard is quite sharp and well focused on the nose but as you move back into the image the boarder is a little soft.  Could be the background overall, but there seems to be a blue cast to this also.  Did you try adjusting the color temp a little to experiment?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717392, 375858, 30049, '<td valign="top">So close...not quite there with the shutter speed as the hammer head and flying pieces are blurred a little.  Lighting is good overall.  How many bulbs did you go thru to get this shot?  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'So close...not quite there with the shutter speed as the hammer head and flying pieces are blurred a little.  Lighting is good overall.  How many bulbs did you go thru to get this shot?  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 11:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717397, 375580, 51695, '<td valign="top">wasn''t this in another challenge a few weeks back?</td>', 'wasn''t this in another challenge a few weeks back?', '2006-08-11 11:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717406, 375809, 51695, '<td valign="top">wow this is awesome, very nice shot</td>', 'wow this is awesome, very nice shot', '2006-08-11 11:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717410, 375614, 51695, '<td valign="top">nice tones! GJ</td>', 'nice tones! GJ', '2006-08-11 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717425, 375059, 30049, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this...really!  ;^)  Went a different direction.  This should do pretty well in the DPC voting community.  It''s clean, simple, fun, well lit and exposed right on.  The lighting on the hand is perfect.  The DNMC police are going to hit you some on the evident motion blur in the cards I think.  Hopefully, for your sake, not TOO hard!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I thought about doing this...really!  ;^)  Went a different direction.  This should do pretty well in the DPC voting community.  It''s clean, simple, fun, well lit and exposed right on.  The lighting on the hand is perfect.  The DNMC police are going to hit you some on the evident motion blur in the cards I think.  Hopefully, for your sake, not TOO hard!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717429, 375435, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the circular lines formed around the bears neck with the water spray.  Big points on the cool factor there.  I''m thinking either your distance to the subject was too close and the focal point off just a smidgen, or your aperture was too shallow, as the forefront water is nice and crisp but the bear and some back spray shows some blur (either DOF or motion).  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the circular lines formed around the bears neck with the water spray.  Big points on the cool factor there.  I''m thinking either your distance to the subject was too close and the focal point off just a smidgen, or your aperture was too shallow, as the forefront water is nice and crisp but the bear and some back spray shows some blur (either DOF or motion).  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717438, 375377, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a fun game.  ;^)  Good job capturing the water spray in right side of the frame.  Motion has been stopped for sure.  The scene itself may be a little ''busy'' to garner high votes here at DPC.  Only negative for me is the exposure looks just a tad dark.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a fun game.  ;^)  Good job capturing the water spray in right side of the frame.  Motion has been stopped for sure.  The scene itself may be a little ''busy'' to garner high votes here at DPC.  Only negative for me is the exposure looks just a tad dark.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717443, 375886, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clean, sharp image.  Front running horse is very well exposed and sharply focused.  Motion has been stopped as needed.  A UV have filter may have knocked out some of the hazy background.  A polarizer could have given the color a little more pop (the red in the jersey is a little subdued), or a small boost in hue sat in post-processing...  Overall a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clean, sharp image.  Front running horse is very well exposed and sharply focused.  Motion has been stopped as needed.  A UV have filter may have knocked out some of the hazy background.  A polarizer could have given the color a little more pop (the red in the jersey is a little subdued), or a small boost in hue sat in post-processing...  Overall a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717449, 375901, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute title and fun idea for the challenge entry image.  Feet and legs are well focused.  Start getting a little soft around the face.  For maximum impact it should be the other way around.  Tough shot at that angle.  I like the body angle as it adds a strong diagonal line to the image.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute title and fun idea for the challenge entry image.  Feet and legs are well focused.  Start getting a little soft around the face.  For maximum impact it should be the other way around.  Tough shot at that angle.  I like the body angle as it adds a strong diagonal line to the image.  All JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717459, 375441, 30049, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail makes me say Yikes!  Fun and scary image at the same time.  I have a good idea of how you''ve done this (will look to photographers comments to confirm afterwards...he-he).  The hand on the right is sharp, the face on the left is not.  That''s what will keep this image from making it to the top IMO.  Good luck...and be careful playing with those guns!!!</td>', 'The thumbnail makes me say Yikes!  Fun and scary image at the same time.  I have a good idea of how you''ve done this (will look to photographers comments to confirm afterwards...he-he).  The hand on the right is sharp, the face on the left is not.  That''s what will keep this image from making it to the top IMO.  Good luck...and be careful playing with those guns!!!', '2006-08-11 11:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717465, 375252, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Well, it''s a nice baseball shot overall.  The ball is still moving as evidenced by the blur.  That''s going to cost you some as the challenge was pretty specific on no motion trails, etc...  I might have cropped the bottom out some to get the batter off-center and bring the subject in a little closer.  JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Well, it''s a nice baseball shot overall.  The ball is still moving as evidenced by the blur.  That''s going to cost you some as the challenge was pretty specific on no motion trails, etc...  I might have cropped the bottom out some to get the batter off-center and bring the subject in a little closer.  JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717476, 375422, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun to look at.  It looks like your main subject moved out of your focus area unfortunately as he is a little blurry.  Would have been cool to capture this shot a split second sooner when he came over the trash can.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is fun to look at.  It looks like your main subject moved out of your focus area unfortunately as he is a little blurry.  Would have been cool to capture this shot a split second sooner when he came over the trash can.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717483, 375514, 30049, '<td valign="top">One of the better bulb shots in the challenge IMO.  Still a bit of motion blur however and that''s going to cost you some in the voting I''m afraid.  I really like the blue on white - very nice combination.  The bulb base is quite sharp and detailed.  I''m wondering if some of the blur in the moving pieces is because of aperture selection and DOF?  Anyway, you''ll probably do fairly well with this nonetheless.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'One of the better bulb shots in the challenge IMO.  Still a bit of motion blur however and that''s going to cost you some in the voting I''m afraid.  I really like the blue on white - very nice combination.  The bulb base is quite sharp and detailed.  I''m wondering if some of the blur in the moving pieces is because of aperture selection and DOF?  Anyway, you''ll probably do fairly well with this nonetheless.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717490, 375726, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh...too bad you didn''t have a star filter on.  Those points of light would have lite up beautifully!   As it is you''re probably getting some comments on the lighting being too harsh and the DOF too shallow (back edge of dish is OOF).  The top drip ball (what do you call it?) is a little blurry.  If that could have been sharp like the center of the dish I think some of the other items I''ve pointed out would have been inconsequential.  Very close to having a top top image here...good luck and keep at it!  ;^)</td>', 'Oh...too bad you didn''t have a star filter on.  Those points of light would have lite up beautifully!   As it is you''re probably getting some comments on the lighting being too harsh and the DOF too shallow (back edge of dish is OOF).  The top drip ball (what do you call it?) is a little blurry.  If that could have been sharp like the center of the dish I think some of the other items I''ve pointed out would have been inconsequential.  Very close to having a top top image here...good luck and keep at it!  ;^)', '2006-08-11 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717495, 374700, 17851, '<td valign="top">nice stopped motion, only thing that bothers me a little is that it looks oversharpened.</td>', 'nice stopped motion, only thing that bothers me a little is that it looks oversharpened.', '2006-08-11 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717498, 375637, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen concrete/stone look like that before.  It''s when I used too much NI!  ;^)  You''ve lost detail with the noise reduction.  The motion of the flag is stopped quite nicely.  This image could stand a slight shift to the left in rotation (1 or 2 degrees) as it''s not lined up horizontally.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve seen concrete/stone look like that before.  It''s when I used too much NI!  ;^)  You''ve lost detail with the noise reduction.  The motion of the flag is stopped quite nicely.  This image could stand a slight shift to the left in rotation (1 or 2 degrees) as it''s not lined up horizontally.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717503, 375507, 30049, '<td valign="top">I would have been tempted to ADD grain to this for an artistic look.  Probably wouldn''t have scored well however.  ;^)  As is, there is a little noise in the sky although it looks like you''ve applied some noise reduction to it already.  The birds are WAY cool.  Love the angle.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  Would be a stronger image if the birds were a little sharper...the image overall seems soft.  JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I would have been tempted to ADD grain to this for an artistic look.  Probably wouldn''t have scored well however.  ;^)  As is, there is a little noise in the sky although it looks like you''ve applied some noise reduction to it already.  The birds are WAY cool.  Love the angle.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  Would be a stronger image if the birds were a little sharper...the image overall seems soft.  JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717505, 375773, 17851, '<td valign="top">awesome stopped motion! Should do very well. Good luck ;)</td>', 'awesome stopped motion! Should do very well. Good luck ;)', '2006-08-11 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717515, 375788, 30049, '<td valign="top">The combination of title and facial expressions brought a smile to my face.  Thanks for that.  ;^)  This is fun to look at and you''ve certainly stopped the motion in an acceptable fashion.  I almost wish this was a little tighter in composition but then you would lose the context of the place and situation.  Perhaps some light gaussian blur to the left and right of the chute would have helped some?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'The combination of title and facial expressions brought a smile to my face.  Thanks for that.  ;^)  This is fun to look at and you''ve certainly stopped the motion in an acceptable fashion.  I almost wish this was a little tighter in composition but then you would lose the context of the place and situation.  Perhaps some light gaussian blur to the left and right of the chute would have helped some?  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717577, 375573, 5834, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2006-08-11 12:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717617, 375875, 40088, '<td valign="top">this is really nice</td>', 'this is really nice', '2006-08-11 12:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717619, 375322, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey this is fun!  The bland sky worked in your favor on this one.  ;^)  Looks like an overcast, flat kind of day for shooting.  You appear to be pretty deep on aperture as the background is all in focus.  Don''t know if you could have done it (may have been too far back from the subject), but a shallower aperture could have blurred that bg out some.  Hmmm...nevermind on the bg blur thing - something about hyperfocal distance I think would have prevented it from where you were standing.  I get the impression you were trying to include a good portion of the scene for context.  Did you try cropping this down some - bottom and right - to get the jumper off-center more and to make him a larger subject for your image?  Just a thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey this is fun!  The bland sky worked in your favor on this one.  ;^)  Looks like an overcast, flat kind of day for shooting.  You appear to be pretty deep on aperture as the background is all in focus.  Don''t know if you could have done it (may have been too far back from the subject), but a shallower aperture could have blurred that bg out some.  Hmmm...nevermind on the bg blur thing - something about hyperfocal distance I think would have prevented it from where you were standing.  I get the impression you were trying to include a good portion of the scene for context.  Did you try cropping this down some - bottom and right - to get the jumper off-center more and to make him a larger subject for your image?  Just a thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717623, 375808, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool.  Amazing how many particles there are in that spray when you get this kind of detail.  Well captured.  Simple, fun, sharp, well lit...hmmm, should do ok with this.  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'This is kind of cool.  Amazing how many particles there are in that spray when you get this kind of detail.  Well captured.  Simple, fun, sharp, well lit...hmmm, should do ok with this.  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 12:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717628, 375507, 40088, '<td valign="top">the angle and the high contrast work well, nice.</td>', 'the angle and the high contrast work well, nice.', '2006-08-11 12:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717637, 375614, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cat lovers will be all over this one!  ;^)  Myself included.  Great detail and I like your choice to go B/W tone.  How in the world did you get this shot anyway?  Just wait?  After feeding?  Hmmm.  Well, I hope this does well for you.  No, it''s not as high tech or as fancy as some of the light bulb or splash shots, but it''s fun...so good luck.</td>', 'Cat lovers will be all over this one!  ;^)  Myself included.  Great detail and I like your choice to go B/W tone.  How in the world did you get this shot anyway?  Just wait?  After feeding?  Hmmm.  Well, I hope this does well for you.  No, it''s not as high tech or as fancy as some of the light bulb or splash shots, but it''s fun...so good luck.', '2006-08-11 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717642, 375836, 62095, '<td valign="top">The bar / edge / fence at the front is very distracting..</td>', 'The bar / edge / fence at the front is very distracting..', '2006-08-11 12:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717643, 375897, 62095, '<td valign="top">Very lively.</td>', 'Very lively.', '2006-08-11 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717644, 375324, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the shadow.  I''ll bet you do too!  ;^)  Very good job of stopping the motion here, especially the skateboard.  You may take a minor hit on the slight blur of the boarder.  The burning of the edges is discrete enough and effective in bringing the viewers eye to center.  The color tone seems a little green to me, but I''m not the best with colors.  You should do pretty well with this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the shadow.  I''ll bet you do too!  ;^)  Very good job of stopping the motion here, especially the skateboard.  You may take a minor hit on the slight blur of the boarder.  The burning of the edges is discrete enough and effective in bringing the viewers eye to center.  The color tone seems a little green to me, but I''m not the best with colors.  You should do pretty well with this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717649, 375586, 40088, '<td valign="top">perfect dof, nice pattern on the umbrella</td>', 'perfect dof, nice pattern on the umbrella', '2006-08-11 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717653, 375579, 62095, '<td valign="top">It took a while looking at this to figure out where the motion was, that''ll probably count against the picture. That said, I like it, though the silver container to the front is distracting a little.</td>', 'It took a while looking at this to figure out where the motion was, that''ll probably count against the picture. That said, I like it, though the silver container to the front is distracting a little.', '2006-08-11 12:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717658, 374632, 30049, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like it''s sitting on a piece of glass.  I''m not saying it is, but it''s so still...good job on stopping the motion.  Only problems I see with this are the subject (it''s a bit static, nothing else going on - so you have to be a bee lover to really like it), it looks a little over-sharpened, and the subject is centered (not always terrible, but there are those that are going to call you on it).  All of this is JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Almost looks like it''s sitting on a piece of glass.  I''m not saying it is, but it''s so still...good job on stopping the motion.  Only problems I see with this are the subject (it''s a bit static, nothing else going on - so you have to be a bee lover to really like it), it looks a little over-sharpened, and the subject is centered (not always terrible, but there are those that are going to call you on it).  All of this is JMO of course.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717667, 375573, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cool move to observe, even better to photograph!  ;^)  Tough lighting situation here.  The sun is a little blown out but I don''t see much choice without some supplemental lighting to use on the soccer player from this angle.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  The more I think about it the more I wish the player was exposed (lit) a little more.  How about fill-flash with the EV set to -1.7 or so?  Just a thought.  Cool pic overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a cool move to observe, even better to photograph!  ;^)  Tough lighting situation here.  The sun is a little blown out but I don''t see much choice without some supplemental lighting to use on the soccer player from this angle.  You''ve stopped the motion pretty well.  The more I think about it the more I wish the player was exposed (lit) a little more.  How about fill-flash with the EV set to -1.7 or so?  Just a thought.  Cool pic overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717676, 375426, 40088, '<td valign="top">Wow perfect action/stopped motion shot!</td>', 'Wow perfect action/stopped motion shot!', '2006-08-11 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717677, 375535, 30049, '<td valign="top">I see you...well, kind of.  ;^)  This is a creative take on the challenge.  Nice rich tone in the chess piece.  Could be my monitor, but the white background looks pixelated and splotchy.  Almost wish I could see the rest of the reflection in the glass.  You know what would have worked really well here is a black background where the tabletop and background could have blended together more and eliminated that line where they meet at the table edge.  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I see you...well, kind of.  ;^)  This is a creative take on the challenge.  Nice rich tone in the chess piece.  Could be my monitor, but the white background looks pixelated and splotchy.  Almost wish I could see the rest of the reflection in the glass.  You know what would have worked really well here is a black background where the tabletop and background could have blended together more and eliminated that line where they meet at the table edge.  Just a thought.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717679, 375278, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve composed this with the bee being positioned in the frame as it is.  Title works well.  Exposure on the flower and the bee is good.  Image overall feels a little soft.  A slightly faster shutter speed would have totally froze (stopped motion) of the wings on the bee.  Overall, a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve composed this with the bee being positioned in the frame as it is.  Title works well.  Exposure on the flower and the bee is good.  Image overall feels a little soft.  A slightly faster shutter speed would have totally froze (stopped motion) of the wings on the bee.  Overall, a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717683, 375422, 40088, '<td valign="top">good composition/perspective pov, the focus on the first guy seems a bit soft</td>', 'good composition/perspective pov, the focus on the first guy seems a bit soft', '2006-08-11 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717686, 373328, 19672, '<td valign="top">Should have brightened his head a bit for more distinction.</td>', 'Should have brightened his head a bit for more distinction.', '2006-08-11 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717697, 374229, 40088, '<td valign="top">nice different crop I like it</td>', 'nice different crop I like it', '2006-08-11 12:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717704, 375849, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice pan shot.  You''ve nearly pulled it off without any blur, just a little bit of motion blur in the wings.  I really like the feet and tail position of the back goose.  Minor bit of noise/grain, most evident in the foreground blue.  Good job leaving a little breathing room in front of the geese for them to "move into".  If this was tack sharp I think it would rise to the top.  As is, you''ll still do pretty well with it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice pan shot.  You''ve nearly pulled it off without any blur, just a little bit of motion blur in the wings.  I really like the feet and tail position of the back goose.  Minor bit of noise/grain, most evident in the foreground blue.  Good job leaving a little breathing room in front of the geese for them to "move into".  If this was tack sharp I think it would rise to the top.  As is, you''ll still do pretty well with it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717708, 375619, 19672, '<td valign="top">Weird...but excellent take...</td>', 'Weird...but excellent take...', '2006-08-11 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717713, 374985, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a good title for this water fountain shot.  You''ve stopped the motion os the water and it''s nice and crisp.  The thing that''s going to hold this back is simply subject matter.  Nothing personal, but there''s not really anything "exciting" about this image.   I hope you got the "not personal" part.  ;^)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a good title for this water fountain shot.  You''ve stopped the motion os the water and it''s nice and crisp.  The thing that''s going to hold this back is simply subject matter.  Nothing personal, but there''s not really anything "exciting" about this image.   I hope you got the "not personal" part.  ;^)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717714, 375898, 19672, '<td valign="top">AM IMPRESSED</td>', 'AM IMPRESSED', '2006-08-11 12:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717720, 375859, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You even captured the patterns in the wings.  Nicely done.  Still feels a little bit soft, and a little noisy.  An interesting crop, makes me wonder what the rest of that hint you''ve left in the bottom left is?  ;^)  This was advanced...could have cloned that little piece out.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  You even captured the patterns in the wings.  Nicely done.  Still feels a little bit soft, and a little noisy.  An interesting crop, makes me wonder what the rest of that hint you''ve left in the bottom left is?  ;^)  This was advanced...could have cloned that little piece out.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717727, 374999, 30049, '<td valign="top">The angle works well here, for me anyway.  Nice panning shot.  You''ve stopped the motion for the most part here.  I''m not seeing the wheel lug nuts - just kidding!  Good luck with this in the challenge.</td>', 'The angle works well here, for me anyway.  Nice panning shot.  You''ve stopped the motion for the most part here.  I''m not seeing the wheel lug nuts - just kidding!  Good luck with this in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
