(2717739, 375435, 5034, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a capture!  Very clear, nice cropping and great timing!  8</td>', 'Wow, what a capture!  Very clear, nice cropping and great timing!  8', '2006-08-11 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717741, 375860, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the water spray just fine, so it qualifies for the ''Stopped Motion'' theme.  The guy in the background is distracting.  It feels like he doesn''t belong in this image...looking away and not involved with the ''surfer'' at al.  Maybe I''m being too picky.  Who knows.  ;^)  Whenever you can, which is pretty much always, you should use the maximum 640 sizing on the long side for challenge entries.  You''ll get more detail in the image, and you''ll keep those at bay that may mark down for it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You''ve captured the water spray just fine, so it qualifies for the ''Stopped Motion'' theme.  The guy in the background is distracting.  It feels like he doesn''t belong in this image...looking away and not involved with the ''surfer'' at al.  Maybe I''m being too picky.  Who knows.  ;^)  Whenever you can, which is pretty much always, you should use the maximum 640 sizing on the long side for challenge entries.  You''ll get more detail in the image, and you''ll keep those at bay that may mark down for it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717743, 375902, 5034, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good clear image and action.  8</td>', 'Very nice, good clear image and action.  8', '2006-08-11 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717746, 375688, 5034, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, got it just right.  Nice clarity and focus.  10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, got it just right.  Nice clarity and focus.  10', '2006-08-11 12:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
