(2717778, 374632, 32378, '<td valign="top">Although the picture is okay, for this challange I think I would like to see the bee in context with it''s surrounding so I can see that the motion is stopped and that this isn''t just a dead bee.  Also compostion is static with the bee centered.</td>', 'Although the picture is okay, for this challange I think I would like to see the bee in context with it''s surrounding so I can see that the motion is stopped and that this isn''t just a dead bee.  Also compostion is static with the bee centered.', '2006-08-11 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
