(2717790, 375809, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nico, is that you?  You know, the Light On White II challenge?  If not nico take it as a compliment.  ;^)<br/> <br/>This should make the front page.  Fun, clever, meets the challenge, clean, etc...  There might be a slight blur to the water coming out of the bowl, but it''s very slight.  On my monitor I''m also seeing where there was some levels/curves applied maybe to blend the background?  Could be this crappy monitor...  Anyway, congrats on a well conceived idea, and execution thereof, for this challenge.</td>', 'Nico, is that you?  You know, the Light On White II challenge?  If not nico take it as a compliment.  ;^) This should make the front page.  Fun, clever, meets the challenge, clean, etc...  There might be a slight blur to the water coming out of the bowl, but it''s very slight.  On my monitor I''m also seeing where there was some levels/curves applied maybe to blend the background?  Could be this crappy monitor...  Anyway, congrats on a well conceived idea, and execution thereof, for this challenge.', '2006-08-11 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717798, 375417, 5034, '<td valign="top">In a word: Wow.  Great timing, focus and composition.  Love the afterburner trails, the circles in them indicate he is over Mach 1.  10</td>', 'In a word: Wow.  Great timing, focus and composition.  Love the afterburner trails, the circles in them indicate he is over Mach 1.  10', '2006-08-11 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717800, 375855, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is tough to catch without some motion blur...I''ve seen a couple of airplane/helicopter shots so far where the prop was actually stopped with high enough shutter speed.  Might take a minor hit on this since the prop is still blurred.  Did you bump the color saturation some?  The blue looks a little overdone - maybe it''s the smoke.  Is the smoke supposed to be blue?  Speaking of smoke, I''m glad this plane has that going on, otherwise this image might be a little too static/documentary to generate any ''wow'' votes.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is tough to catch without some motion blur...I''ve seen a couple of airplane/helicopter shots so far where the prop was actually stopped with high enough shutter speed.  Might take a minor hit on this since the prop is still blurred.  Did you bump the color saturation some?  The blue looks a little overdone - maybe it''s the smoke.  Is the smoke supposed to be blue?  Speaking of smoke, I''m glad this plane has that going on, otherwise this image might be a little too static/documentary to generate any ''wow'' votes. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 13:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717829, 375891, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but the blue cast in the foreground might hurt your score here (I think it''s an interesting effect).</td>', 'I like this shot, but the blue cast in the foreground might hurt your score here (I think it''s an interesting effect).', '2006-08-11 13:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717831, 374308, 30049, '<td valign="top">Look at that flying dirt!  Certainly stopped the motion there.  ;^)  This image is well composed regarding positioning of subject.  The track line, where the dirt meets the trees, adds a nice diagonal line.  One problem with the dust in the air is that it makes the image feel a little flat, whether it is or not.  A little tighter shot of the action may have worked better for you in this challenge.  The cars are an interesting subject.  I certainly would be going after some photo op''s if this venue was available!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Look at that flying dirt!  Certainly stopped the motion there.  ;^)  This image is well composed regarding positioning of subject.  The track line, where the dirt meets the trees, adds a nice diagonal line.  One problem with the dust in the air is that it makes the image feel a little flat, whether it is or not.  A little tighter shot of the action may have worked better for you in this challenge.  The cars are an interesting subject.  I certainly would be going after some photo op''s if this venue was available!  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717838, 374058, 33552, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the crop tight. I might take a little more off of the left side and try to leave a little more space ahead of the splash.</td>', 'Good job keeping the crop tight. I might take a little more off of the left side and try to leave a little more space ahead of the splash.', '2006-08-11 13:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717839, 375260, 30049, '<td valign="top">You made it!  Ok, shots for everybody!  ;^)  Nice capture here.  Strobe lights?  Congrats in advance on your high finish.  Well done.</td>', 'You made it!  Ok, shots for everybody!  ;^)  Nice capture here.  Strobe lights?  Congrats in advance on your high finish.  Well done.', '2006-08-11 13:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717842, 374122, 30049, '<td valign="top">What did you use, a bucket?!  ;^)  Great stream of water there.  Hope you had fun getting this shot.  Works well for this challenge.  The water coming in at an angle adds to this image.  Image is pretty sharp and exposed properly.  Should do pretty well with this one.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What did you use, a bucket?!  ;^)  Great stream of water there.  Hope you had fun getting this shot.  Works well for this challenge.  The water coming in at an angle adds to this image.  Image is pretty sharp and exposed properly.  Should do pretty well with this one.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 13:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717845, 375832, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The only fault I can find is the softness around his face. I''m not sure if this is a result of processing or if the DOF could have been a little greater. Great timing!</td>', 'Nice shot. The only fault I can find is the softness around his face. I''m not sure if this is a result of processing or if the DOF could have been a little greater. Great timing!', '2006-08-11 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
