(2717908, 374934, 32378, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of stopping the action, very hard to do with this bird.  Composition is good, although I may have left more space for it to fly into and a little more on the bottom for it to look down towards.</td>', 'Excellent job of stopping the action, very hard to do with this bird.  Composition is good, although I may have left more space for it to fly into and a little more on the bottom for it to look down towards.', '2006-08-11 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
