(2717922, 374742, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp, especially the jockey.  A little blur around the horse''s hooves, but nothing too major.  Nice color, background isn''t too distracting.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and crisp, especially the jockey.  A little blur around the horse''s hooves, but nothing too major.  Nice color, background isn''t too distracting.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
