(2717925, 375803, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job freezing the ball!  The red batter''s shirt gives this image a nice pop.  The background is a little distracting (cars) but not sure what the workaround is for that.  BTW - did he hit it?  ;^)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice job freezing the ball!  The red batter''s shirt gives this image a nice pop.  The background is a little distracting (cars) but not sure what the workaround is for that.  BTW - did he hit it?  ;^)  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717927, 374085, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good job stopping the action.  Lighting seems a little harsh and I may have cropped this a little diffently so plan wasn''t in the center to give the impression of either taking off or landing.</td>', 'Good job stopping the action.  Lighting seems a little harsh and I may have cropped this a little diffently so plan wasn''t in the center to give the impression of either taking off or landing.', '2006-08-11 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
