(2717930, 375435, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the water swirling.  Lighting is a little harsh.</td>', 'Nice effect with the water swirling.  Lighting is a little harsh.', '2006-08-11 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717931, 373842, 30049, '<td valign="top">They look hungry to me.  ;^)  Ok.  I''m not sure where to look.  You have multiple subjects here, none of which are totally in the photo.  Image is a bit dark (heavy shadows), and the image is a little soft and blurry.  I''m thinking that the horse''s tail is what drew you into taking this image?  The motion there has been stopped so you''re fine for meeting the challenge in that regard.  Sorry I don''t have much positive to say.  I think the biggest single thing holding this image back is a clear story line.  Best of luck to you.  Keep at it!</td>', 'They look hungry to me.  ;^)  Ok.  I''m not sure where to look.  You have multiple subjects here, none of which are totally in the photo.  Image is a bit dark (heavy shadows), and the image is a little soft and blurry.  I''m thinking that the horse''s tail is what drew you into taking this image?  The motion there has been stopped so you''re fine for meeting the challenge in that regard.  Sorry I don''t have much positive to say.  I think the biggest single thing holding this image back is a clear story line.  Best of luck to you.  Keep at it!', '2006-08-11 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717933, 375796, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Very nice capture of the ''commando'' in the air AND the water is stopped nicely too.  Added noise intentionally?  If yes, you''re a brave soul.  ;^)  The B/W tone works well here, might be a tad light on contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this shot.  Very nice capture of the ''commando'' in the air AND the water is stopped nicely too.  Added noise intentionally?  If yes, you''re a brave soul.  ;^)  The B/W tone works well here, might be a tad light on contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717936, 375771, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  Composition is very good. I''m usually not a big fan of selective desaturation, however it works very well in this image to draw you attention to the couple.</td>', 'I like this alot.  Composition is very good. I''m usually not a big fan of selective desaturation, however it works very well in this image to draw you attention to the couple.', '2006-08-11 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717938, 375741, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good job stopping the action.  However, the grass seems oversharpened and the lighting very harsh due to the time of day.</td>', 'Good job stopping the action.  However, the grass seems oversharpened and the lighting very harsh due to the time of day.', '2006-08-11 14:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717940, 375591, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I hope he clears those rocks!  I like seeing this in B/W.  I think it probably helps to keep the focus on the jumper and eliminate other distractions.  Only suggestion is maybe to add a shot of contrast - looks a tad bit flat.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yikes!  I hope he clears those rocks!  I like seeing this in B/W.  I think it probably helps to keep the focus on the jumper and eliminate other distractions.  Only suggestion is maybe to add a shot of contrast - looks a tad bit flat.  Good luck.', '2006-08-11 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717942, 375422, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice job, good composition.</td>', 'Nice job, good composition.', '2006-08-11 14:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717946, 375580, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good choice to rotate this.  Works great this way.  I''ll be surprised if this doesn''t make the front page.  Stopped motion - yes.  Fun to look at - yes.  Clean, sharp, properly exposed, and easily identified subject - yes.  Well done!</td>', 'Good choice to rotate this.  Works great this way.  I''ll be surprised if this doesn''t make the front page.  Stopped motion - yes.  Fun to look at - yes.  Clean, sharp, properly exposed, and easily identified subject - yes.  Well done!', '2006-08-11 14:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717948, 375835, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very tought to stop the wings on these birds, you did a good job.  Think I would have done a little dodging (or burning I can never keep them straight) do darken the feeder and perch slightly.</td>', 'Very tought to stop the wings on these birds, you did a good job.  Think I would have done a little dodging (or burning I can never keep them straight) do darken the feeder and perch slightly.', '2006-08-11 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717950, 375696, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good job stopping the action, however lighting is a lttle to harsh for my taste.</td>', 'Good job stopping the action, however lighting is a lttle to harsh for my taste.', '2006-08-11 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717954, 375379, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oops!  A bit on the small size.  Probably already heard that a few times by now...  I think the concept of your image is fine.  There are a lot of water shots in this challenge, but yours is unique.  Looks like this wall is in the shade causing it to be underexposed some.  You can try using some fill-flash in this situation.  If your camera allows adjusting the level of flash output knock it down a few stops.  I''ve found -1.3 or -1.7EV to work well for a fill light adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oops!  A bit on the small size.  Probably already heard that a few times by now...  I think the concept of your image is fine.  There are a lot of water shots in this challenge, but yours is unique.  Looks like this wall is in the shade causing it to be underexposed some.  You can try using some fill-flash in this situation.  If your camera allows adjusting the level of flash output knock it down a few stops.  I''ve found -1.3 or -1.7EV to work well for a fill light adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717958, 375912, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good job stopping the action, I would have liked this more if I could have seen one of their faces more clearly.</td>', 'Good job stopping the action, I would have liked this more if I could have seen one of their faces more clearly.', '2006-08-11 14:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717962, 375568, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not sure the vignetting is needed here.  At least not for me...it''s more of a distraction than helpful given the size of the subject in the overall frame.  The feathers on that gull are mighty smooth!  Looks like some detail was lost along the way in post-processing.  Yes?  Noise reduction was likely a little too heavy.  I really like the warm lighting on the gull - very well exposed for this light.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure the vignetting is needed here.  At least not for me...it''s more of a distraction than helpful given the size of the subject in the overall frame.  The feathers on that gull are mighty smooth!  Looks like some detail was lost along the way in post-processing.  Yes?  Noise reduction was likely a little too heavy.  I really like the warm lighting on the gull - very well exposed for this light.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717963, 375655, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nice capture.  interesting subject, captivating colors.</td>', 'very nice capture.  interesting subject, captivating colors.', '2006-08-11 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717965, 375754, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a real good image if taken from a lower perspective and more zoomed in on her (I know that is not always possible).  All the people and clutter in the background detract from the image.</td>', 'I think this could have been a real good image if taken from a lower perspective and more zoomed in on her (I know that is not always possible).  All the people and clutter in the background detract from the image.', '2006-08-11 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717966, 374122, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent idea.  bet you had a lot of fun with this shoot.</td>', 'excellent idea.  bet you had a lot of fun with this shoot.', '2006-08-11 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717973, 375904, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome.  this is dpc-perfect! no clutter, no mess, sharp, to the point.  i expect to see this on the front page.</td>', 'awesome.  this is dpc-perfect! no clutter, no mess, sharp, to the point.  i expect to see this on the front page.', '2006-08-11 14:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717977, 375311, 32378, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if it is the post processing or time of day but lighting seems harsh and to contrasty for my taste.  I would have liked to been brought more into the action, perhaps with not as much foreground.</td>', 'Don''t know if it is the post processing or time of day but lighting seems harsh and to contrasty for my taste.  I would have liked to been brought more into the action, perhaps with not as much foreground.', '2006-08-11 14:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717980, 373328, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and color here.  One of the first things that comes to mind when I viewed this image.  You''ve done a nice job of stopping the motion.  The image is well exposed and sharp.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice contrast and color here.  One of the first things that comes to mind when I viewed this image.  You''ve done a nice job of stopping the motion.  The image is well exposed and sharp.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717981, 375379, 23394, '<td valign="top">you have the right idea, but, i''m guessing that you''re fairly new to dpc.  if so, don''t take the scores and comments to seriously.  you do need to submit as large as an image as you can (if you need help with this, ask in the forums).  just remember, everybody has to start someplace...</td>', 'you have the right idea, but, i''m guessing that you''re fairly new to dpc.  if so, don''t take the scores and comments to seriously.  you do need to submit as large as an image as you can (if you need help with this, ask in the forums).  just remember, everybody has to start someplace...', '2006-08-11 14:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717983, 375710, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice stop of the action.  I think this would have worked better without the water and a different back ground and just tossing the pasta.</td>', 'Nice stop of the action.  I think this would have worked better without the water and a different back ground and just tossing the pasta.', '2006-08-11 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717987, 375547, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The image is a little on the soft/fuzzy side.  Also looks like some additional contrast would help some.  Were you including the foreground for context?  Is it something she is jumping off of?  It almost looks like a mistake.  Not sure how to explain it...sorry.  I guess if you are going to have the wall there, include a little bit more or lose it entirely.  You had a nice sky to work with.  A polarizing filter may have deepend the blue some for you.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The image is a little on the soft/fuzzy side.  Also looks like some additional contrast would help some.  Were you including the foreground for context?  Is it something she is jumping off of?  It almost looks like a mistake.  Not sure how to explain it...sorry.  I guess if you are going to have the wall there, include a little bit more or lose it entirely.  You had a nice sky to work with.  A polarizing filter may have deepend the blue some for you.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2717989, 375796, 23394, '<td valign="top">gotta love those trampolines ;-)  you probably could have dodged the water spray just a bit more to bring it out.  as is, it looks more like a sword that a blast from a water gun.</td>', 'gotta love those trampolines ;-)  you probably could have dodged the water spray just a bit more to bring it out.  as is, it looks more like a sword that a blast from a water gun.', '2006-08-11 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
