(2718273, 375909, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely captured.  wish the subject was a little sharper, though.  with all the brown in the water and background, this might have been a good candidate for a bw conversion.</td>', 'nicely captured.  wish the subject was a little sharper, though.  with all the brown in the water and background, this might have been a good candidate for a bw conversion.', '2006-08-11 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
