(2718302, 375756, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job of stopping the action here.  I also want to say bravo on exposing the water properly.  The surfer is coming into the image at a nice angle.  This works very well, as does the natural line formed by the surf.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good job of stopping the action here.  I also want to say bravo on exposing the water properly.  The surfer is coming into the image at a nice angle.  This works very well, as does the natural line formed by the surf.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-11 16:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
