(2719103, 375873, 51802, '<td valign="top">The ice cream doesn''t seem natural to me.  I would not expect perfect scoops if it had been dropped from a cone.  Also, none of the flavors have mixed where they they should have been touching.  This just leaves me with a feeling that this is a little TOO staged.</td>', 'The ice cream doesn''t seem natural to me.  I would not expect perfect scoops if it had been dropped from a cone.  Also, none of the flavors have mixed where they they should have been touching.  This just leaves me with a feeling that this is a little TOO staged.', '2006-08-11 20:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
