(2719114, 375739, 51802, '<td valign="top">I love your title!  Great job captureing the wings.  I have tried to shoot these guys before and it is very tricky.  You really need to pay attention to your background though, it really detracts from this shot.</td>', 'I love your title!  Great job captureing the wings.  I have tried to shoot these guys before and it is very tricky.  You really need to pay attention to your background though, it really detracts from this shot.', '2006-08-11 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
