(2720658, 374344, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice stop and I think the desat is effective.<br/> <br/>The weird thing though, as I look at this, I get a strange sense that the yolk is RISING INTO the shell, instead of falling from it.  Kind of like I''m watching a video of it is reverse.  Strange, I know.</td>', 'Nice stop and I think the desat is effective. The weird thing though, as I look at this, I get a strange sense that the yolk is RISING INTO the shell, instead of falling from it.  Kind of like I''m watching a video of it is reverse.  Strange, I know.', '2006-08-12 14:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720878, 374465, 63772, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is, but something about this really grabs my attention and makes me feel really good.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is, but something about this really grabs my attention and makes me feel really good.', '2006-08-12 16:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720948, 374344, 63811, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.  I love the color enhancements to the yolk and shell and leaving the white clear is perfect.</td>', 'Awesome picture.  I love the color enhancements to the yolk and shell and leaving the white clear is perfect.', '2006-08-12 17:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720954, 375660, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice framing for this capture.  It''s not easy to keep up with these guys flying around.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice framing for this capture.  It''s not easy to keep up with these guys flying around.  Good job.', '2006-08-12 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720955, 375542, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  You were able to keep all jets in the picture which is not easy at this speed.  I also like the color.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice framing.  You were able to keep all jets in the picture which is not easy at this speed.  I also like the color.  Good job.', '2006-08-12 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720958, 375417, 29770, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, especially of the jet exhaust.  I wish the sky had a little more color, but it''s a nice picture anyway.</td>', 'Nice capture, especially of the jet exhaust.  I wish the sky had a little more color, but it''s a nice picture anyway.', '2006-08-12 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720960, 374934, 29770, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice capture.  It''s not easy to keep up with birds in flight and get good focus too.</td>', 'Wow, nice capture.  It''s not easy to keep up with birds in flight and get good focus too.', '2006-08-12 17:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2720961, 375678, 29770, '<td valign="top">Great colors and an obvious stop motion capture.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great colors and an obvious stop motion capture.  Very nice!', '2006-08-12 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
