(2721220, 375535, 63913, '<td valign="top">Im loving the tone of the chees peice. it has a nice classic feel to it and a modern color scheme. I somewhat wish that the balls were more in focus but this def. leads your eye to the Best peice of action in the shot.</td>', 'Im loving the tone of the chees peice. it has a nice classic feel to it and a modern color scheme. I somewhat wish that the balls were more in focus but this def. leads your eye to the Best peice of action in the shot.', '2006-08-12 20:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
