(2721411, 375809, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great job with the whole set, lighting, composition, etc. Remembering seeing a similar shot once before and like this one a lot more. Very well done. The fish may be a printout? if so you''ve made it look very real and the whole splash is awesome. 10</td>', 'Great job with the whole set, lighting, composition, etc. Remembering seeing a similar shot once before and like this one a lot more. Very well done. The fish may be a printout? if so you''ve made it look very real and the whole splash is awesome. 10', '2006-08-12 22:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721412, 375463, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great capture! the hat flying off give this shot that special touch.</td>', 'Great capture! the hat flying off give this shot that special touch.', '2006-08-12 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721589, 375426, 29011, '<td valign="top">Funny and fun capture. Look at those two expressions! :)</td>', 'Funny and fun capture. Look at those two expressions! :)', '2006-08-13 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721595, 375827, 29011, '<td valign="top">The diver being parallel to the horizon...a perfect split moment capture. Great timing and great shot.</td>', 'The diver being parallel to the horizon...a perfect split moment capture. Great timing and great shot.', '2006-08-13 00:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721613, 374999, 29011, '<td valign="top">This shot looks really good, and I like it alot.  But, it''s very much on the borderline of not being stop motion capture. The car frame is sharp as a tack but the wheels and background isn''t so I''m not certain how well it fits the theme. Still give it a 7, would''ve rated higher if this was the panning or motion blur challenge.</td>', 'This shot looks really good, and I like it alot.  But, it''s very much on the borderline of not being stop motion capture. The car frame is sharp as a tack but the wheels and background isn''t so I''m not certain how well it fits the theme. Still give it a 7, would''ve rated higher if this was the panning or motion blur challenge.', '2006-08-13 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2721618, 375873, 29011, '<td valign="top">Charming capture. All the editing is spot on except the strawberry and vanilla scoops have darkened edges (from the burning tool perhaps?), the chocolate scoop looks great though.</td>', 'Charming capture. All the editing is spot on except the strawberry and vanilla scoops have darkened edges (from the burning tool perhaps?), the chocolate scoop looks great though.', '2006-08-13 00:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
