(2724303, 375773, 48717, '<td valign="top">Very nice job...I actually like this one better than the first.  The arrow and the ballon are much easier to discern.  Lets you know exactly what is going on in an instant.</td>', 'Very nice job...I actually like this one better than the first.  The arrow and the ballon are much easier to discern.  Lets you know exactly what is going on in an instant.', '2006-08-14 02:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2724355, 375465, 27164, '<td valign="top">I love the shallow DOF and the spur-of-the-moment feel to this.  Certainly an excellent capture.  My only gripe is the softness / slight motion blur in her right arm.</td>', 'I love the shallow DOF and the spur-of-the-moment feel to this.  Certainly an excellent capture.  My only gripe is the softness / slight motion blur in her right arm.', '2006-08-14 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 0),
