(2724366, 375873, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume those 36 people that voted this a 10 never deduct any points for DNMC. However, I can see why people would like this as it''s very professional. Congrats on your ribbon.<br/> <br/>Edited for spelling.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-14 01:59:40.</i></td>', 'I''m going to assume those 36 people that voted this a 10 never deduct any points for DNMC. However, I can see why people would like this as it''s very professional. Congrats on your ribbon. Edited for spelling.', '2006-08-14 02:58:54.000000', '2006-08-14 02:59:40.000000', 0),
(2724373, 375580, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats. That was really awesome.</td>', 'Congrats. That was really awesome.', '2006-08-14 03:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2724381, 375809, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats! That is a lot of favs you got there and I can see why. Water splashes plus live creatures used as props do quite well I''ve noticed. :P <br/> <br/>I assume that fish didn''t jump out but was tossed up by you or hung on a line?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-14 02:07:04.</i></td>', 'Congrats! That is a lot of favs you got there and I can see why. Water splashes plus live creatures used as props do quite well I''ve noticed. :P  I assume that fish didn''t jump out but was tossed up by you or hung on a line?', '2006-08-14 03:06:05.000000', '2006-08-14 03:07:04.000000', 0),
(2724396, 375722, 41337, '<td valign="top">Your bulb shot kicked my bulb shot''s ass. Congrats dude.</td>', 'Your bulb shot kicked my bulb shot''s ass. Congrats dude.', '2006-08-14 03:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2724412, 375614, 19959, '<td valign="top">Hi All.... Thanks for the many kind words...<br/>I''d like to say that I am a photographer with a talent for exceptional timing and a creative eye... but if I am I didn''t really use it for this entry :-)<br/> <br/>I was testing out my Bigma (50-500) and my cat happened to be sitting conveniently 20 yards away on a bench... I took a couple of shots from cover but was spotted... hence the pissed expression. (He really hates having a camera pointed at him and 80% of my shots turn out to be of the other end of him as he walks away!!)<br/> <br/>One of three shots produced this entry and to be 100% honest it was only as I sat browsing through my weekend shots that I checked to see if I had a ''fit'' to a challenge. I thought the mid-lick might qualify for stopped motion.<br/> <br/>1/250, ISO 800, 500mm, Canon 5D, Sigma 50-500<br/> <br/>Post Processing: RAW - Photoshop CS2 - Desaturate, Tone, Square Crop, Re-size, Sharpen and Save for Web.<br/> <br/>Thanks Again...<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Hi All.... Thanks for the many kind words...I''d like to say that I am a photographer with a talent for exceptional timing and a creative eye... but if I am I didn''t really use it for this entry :-) I was testing out my Bigma (50-500) and my cat happened to be sitting conveniently 20 yards away on a bench... I took a couple of shots from cover but was spotted... hence the pissed expression. (He really hates having a camera pointed at him and 80% of my shots turn out to be of the other end of him as he walks away!!) One of three shots produced this entry and to be 100% honest it was only as I sat browsing through my weekend shots that I checked to see if I had a ''fit'' to a challenge. I thought the mid-lick might qualify for stopped motion. 1/250, ISO 800, 500mm, Canon 5D, Sigma 50-500 Post Processing: RAW - Photoshop CS2 - Desaturate, Tone, Square Crop, Re-size, Sharpen and Save for Web. Thanks Again... Chris', '2006-08-14 03:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2724422, 375580, 18450, '<td valign="top">Wicked shot.........Congrats on your very well deserved ribbon Skip!! <br/> <br/>WTG Lexa.... this is such an awesome action (and the water gets right up your nose when you do it!!)</td>', 'Wicked shot.........Congrats on your very well deserved ribbon Skip!!  WTG Lexa.... this is such an awesome action (and the water gets right up your nose when you do it!!)', '2006-08-14 03:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2724426, 375507, 16241, '<td valign="top">7 favs and look where you came.  doh<br/> <br/>smooth editing, you should have beat me at least :P</td>', '7 favs and look where you came.  doh smooth editing, you should have beat me at least :P', '2006-08-14 03:21:34.000000', NULL, 0);
