(2724463, 374295, 44761, '<td valign="top">Hi and thanks to all the comments.  Out of luck this happened to be the first bulb i dropped.  As some of you guessed it was dropped onto a mirror, i was trying to get the bulb to smash with the bayonet fixing also in the reflection to show it was a mirror.  The bulb was white and the hue''s were changed to give a blue look.  On the original there was small bits of glass flying, i cloned these out as they were so small they looked more like dust particles. Cheers :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-18 06:06:15.</i></td>', 'Hi and thanks to all the comments.  Out of luck this happened to be the first bulb i dropped.  As some of you guessed it was dropped onto a mirror, i was trying to get the bulb to smash with the bayonet fixing also in the reflection to show it was a mirror.  The bulb was white and the hue''s were changed to give a blue look.  On the original there was small bits of glass flying, i cloned these out as they were so small they looked more like dust particles. Cheers :-)', '2006-08-14 03:37:43.000000', '2006-08-18 07:06:15.000000', 0),
