(2724479, 375809, 16230, '<td valign="top">Let me guess...<br/> <br/>The fish isn''t real. It was printed on the background, right?<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a cool shot. Congrats on the ribbon!<br/> <br/>&lt;eta&gt;<br/> <br/>A little nod to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24976" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nico_blue</a> would have been nice. :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=248997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/395/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_248997.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/395/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_248997.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/395/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_248997.jpg"/></a> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-05 19:47:55.</i></td>', 'Let me guess... The fish isn''t real. It was printed on the background, right? Anyway, it''s a cool shot. Congrats on the ribbon! <eta> A little nod to  nico_blue would have been nice. :) ', '2006-08-14 03:47:31.000000', '2009-02-05 19:47:55.000000', 0),
