(2724928, 375580, 35357, '<td valign="top">Skip, congrats on another ribbon, I knew you were up to no good! :-)<br/> <br/>My wife was watching as I was flipping through all the entries (didn''t vote on this challenge, though)and when I came to this one I stopped for a bit and we both said, "Wow, that''s really cool!"<br/> <br/>Great exposure.  High enough shutter speed?  Hehe.  The rotate was a unique idea, though to me it would be better to leave it au natural, as the background water is a giveaway to the original orientation hence just causing me to rotate my head when I look at it.  I found the crop to be a tough choice in my own entry, as I had a lot of leaway.  I wonder if you had a tough time deciding for this entry, as it is a wonderful spiral.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Slippy</td>', 'Skip, congrats on another ribbon, I knew you were up to no good! :-) My wife was watching as I was flipping through all the entries (didn''t vote on this challenge, though)and when I came to this one I stopped for a bit and we both said, "Wow, that''s really cool!" Great exposure.  High enough shutter speed?  Hehe.  The rotate was a unique idea, though to me it would be better to leave it au natural, as the background water is a giveaway to the original orientation hence just causing me to rotate my head when I look at it.  I found the crop to be a tough choice in my own entry, as I had a lot of leaway.  I wonder if you had a tough time deciding for this entry, as it is a wonderful spiral. Cheers,Slippy', '2006-08-14 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
