(2790909, 374947, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hiya Sid..<br/>Welcome to DPC.. .<br/>I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently..<br/> <br/>Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)<br/>Cheers<br/>----------------------------------------<br/> <br/>Saw some of the comments on the other photos..<br/>Don''t be discouraged.. you''ll be improving in no time.. :)<br/> <br/>This is a lovely shot. Great capture.. As the others had said.. 2 things..<br/>1) Sharper focus on "Black Lab"<br/>2) tighter crop to give it an "action pack" look.. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps.. :)</td>', 'Hiya Sid..Welcome to DPC.. .I''m going through all the new DPCers and dropping a comment each for all that''s joined from recently.. Hope you have a pleasent stay here.. :)Cheers---------------------------------------- Saw some of the comments on the other photos..Don''t be discouraged.. you''ll be improving in no time.. :) This is a lovely shot. Great capture.. As the others had said.. 2 things..1) Sharper focus on "Black Lab"2) tighter crop to give it an "action pack" look..  Hope this helps.. :)', '2006-09-03 03:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2793832, 375851, 52336, '<td valign="top">I like this entry, and I''m a big fan of saturated blues, so this works well for me.  There''s a real sense of movement helped by the effluence beneath the dolphin, and its placement in frame is very satisfying.  The grain detracts slightly, but overall well done.  I must say I really like the alternative.  There were similar in recent challenges, but that one''s well composed and very interesting.</td>', 'I like this entry, and I''m a big fan of saturated blues, so this works well for me.  There''s a real sense of movement helped by the effluence beneath the dolphin, and its placement in frame is very satisfying.  The grain detracts slightly, but overall well done.  I must say I really like the alternative.  There were similar in recent challenges, but that one''s well composed and very interesting.', '2006-09-04 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 0),
