(2797669, 375851, 37858, '<td valign="top">But for the graininess this would be a top 10 IMHO.  It has great color, the correography is perfect, great stopped action, ...and dolphins are the best "feel good" animal on the planet (finishing just ahead of frogs, kittens and puppies).  ;-)</td>', 'But for the graininess this would be a top 10 IMHO.  It has great color, the correography is perfect, great stopped action, ...and dolphins are the best "feel good" animal on the planet (finishing just ahead of frogs, kittens and puppies).  ;-)', '2006-09-04 19:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
