(2863510, 375612, 18552, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught this little bug just before it landed. You have a way with your extension tubes, Van. I got some a while back and can use the 12mm one okay but have great difficulty achieving focus with the 25mm one. Have never taken a single decent picture with it. Can''t imagine stacking them.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like how you caught this little bug just before it landed. You have a way with your extension tubes, Van. I got some a while back and can use the 12mm one okay but have great difficulty achieving focus with the 25mm one. Have never taken a single decent picture with it. Can''t imagine stacking them. ', '2006-09-25 14:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
